#. [ES10-0001] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: start / default | Text role: name | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:18
#. msgctxt "ES10-0001"
msgid "Endless Sky"
msgstr "エンドレス・スカイ"

#. [ES10-0002] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: start / default | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:19
#msgctxt "ES10-0002"
msgid "You grew up on New Boston, an uninteresting world in the Dirt Belt. You've dreamed of owning a starship ever since your first visit to the spaceport. After years of working at a textile mill, you've saved enough credits to apply for a pilot's license from the Republic. Now you must take out a loan on your first ship..."
msgstr "あなたはダートベルトの退屈な世界、ニューボストンで育ちました。宇宙港を初めて訪れて以来、あなたは宇宙船を持つことを夢見てきました。繊維工場で何年も働いた後、あなたは共和国のパイロット免許を申請するのに十分なクレジットを貯めました。今、あなたは最初の宇宙船のためにローンを組まなければなりません…"

#. [ES10-0003] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: start / default | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:20
#msgctxt "ES10-0003"
msgid "{1}This is the classic Endless Sky experience. You will begin in debt, and must use your new starship to pay off your mortgage."
msgstr "{1}これがエンドレス・スカイの定番のプレイ体験です。借金を抱えた状態で始まり、新しい宇宙船を使って船のローンを返済しなければなりません。"

#. [ES10-0004] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: log | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:74
msgctxt "ES10-0004"
msgid "Finally scraped together enough money to buy a pilot's license. The interest on the mortgage for my starship is exorbitant."
msgstr "ようやくパイロット免許を買えるだけの金をかき集めた。宇宙船のローンの金利は法外だ。"

#. [ES10-0005] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook category | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0009] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook category | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0013] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook category | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:79
msgctxt "ES10-0005"
msgid "Factions"
msgstr "派閥"

#. [ES10-0006] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook heading | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:75
msgctxt "ES10-0006"
msgid "Republic"
msgstr "共和国"

#. [ES10-0007] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook text | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:75
msgctxt "ES10-0007"
msgid "Hundreds of years ago, the independent territories in different parts of human space agreed to join together into a single democratic government, with Earth as its capital. The rise of the Republic ushered in a long period of peace and prosperity in human history."
msgstr "何百年も前、人類が居住する宇宙の各地にあった独立領域は、地球を首都とする単一の民主政府の下にまとまることに合意しました。共和国の台頭は、人類史に長い平和と繁栄の時代をもたらしました。"

#. [ES10-0008] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: log continuation | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:76
msgctxt "ES10-0008"
msgid "Representation in the Republic Parliament is based on population. That means that some individual \"Paradise Worlds\" have more representatives than entire regions of space like the Dirt Belt that are more sparsely settled."
msgstr "共和国議会の議席は人口に応じて配分されます。つまり、「楽園惑星」の中には、人口のまばらなダートベルトのような地域全体よりも、たった一つの惑星で多くの議員を擁するところもあるのです。"

#. [ES10-0010] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook heading | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:77
msgctxt "ES10-0010"
msgid "Syndicate"
msgstr "シンジケート"

#. [ES10-0011] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook text | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:77
msgctxt "ES10-0011"
msgid "The Syndicate is a megacorporation, the largest employer in human space. People who cannot find steady work elsewhere flock to the Syndicate factory worlds, where they are almost guaranteed to find a job. Although the Syndicate is technically part of the Republic, Syndicate worlds are governed directly by the corporation."
msgstr "シンジケートは巨大企業であり、人類が居住する宇宙で最大の雇用主です。ほかで安定した仕事を見つけられない人々がシンジケートの工場惑星に集まり、そこではほぼ確実に仕事が見つかります。シンジケートは形式上は共和国の一部ですが、その惑星はシンジケート社が直接統治しています。"

#. [ES10-0012] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: log continuation | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:78
msgctxt "ES10-0012"
msgid "The Syndicate is a central part of the Republic's economy, but they are also well known for selling shoddy products and for doing damage to the environment on the worlds they control. Their treatment of workers is questionable, and their opposition to organized labor is legendary. Some Syndicate factory towns have even been accused of human rights abuses."
msgstr "シンジケートは共和国経済の中心的な存在ですが、粗悪な製品を販売することや、支配下の惑星の環境を破壊することでもよく知られています。労働者の扱いには疑問があり、労働組合への反対姿勢は悪名高いものです。シンジケートの工場町の中には、人権侵害を告発されたところさえあります。"

#. [ES10-0014] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook heading | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:79
msgctxt "ES10-0014"
msgid "Pirates"
msgstr "海賊"

#. [ES10-0015] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: logbook text | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:79
msgctxt "ES10-0015"
msgid "In poorer and more remote star systems, where the Navy seldom patrols, pirate attacks on merchant ships are frequent. Pirates are also known to attack large, unguarded convoys of freighters even in more populated areas. Most pirate fleets come from lawless worlds on the outskirts of human space."
msgstr "海軍の巡回がめったにない貧しく辺境の星系では、商船への海賊の襲撃が頻発しています。海賊は、人口の多い地域でさえ、護衛のついていない大規模な貨物船団を襲撃することがあります。海賊艦隊のほとんどは、人類の居住域の外縁にある無法の惑星からやって来ます。"

#. [ES10-0016] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:81
msgctxt "ES10-0016"
msgid "The bank's architecture is what you would have called \"futuristic\" back when you dreamed that the future would be less squalid than the present: story above story of curves and spires and balconies, all in gleaming metal. A doorman stands by each of the heavy glass doors. You are wearing your very best clothes, but you feel shabby next to them."
msgstr "銀行の建物は、未来は今よりもみすぼらしくないはずだと夢見ていた頃なら「未来的」と呼んでいたような姿をしています。曲線や尖塔、バルコニーがきらめく金属でできた階層を幾重にもなしています。重厚なガラス扉のそれぞれの脇にはドアマンが立っています。あなたは一番いい服を着ていますが、彼らと比べると自分がみすぼらしく感じられます。"

#. [ES10-0017] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:82
msgctxt "ES10-0017"
msgid "{1}The loan broker's office is equally intimidating. Large computer monitors fill the walls, with stock quotes and other information spilling down them almost too fast to read. You occasionally glimpse the names of places that you have only seen in movies: Aldebaran. Tarazed. Earth."
msgstr "{1}融資仲介業者のオフィスも同様に威圧的です。大きなコンピュータモニタが壁を埋め尽くし、株価やその他の情報が読むのが追いつかないほどの速さで流れ落ちています。映画でしか見たことのない場所の名前が時折目に飛び込んできます。アルデバラン。タラゼド。地球。"

#. [ES10-0018] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:83
msgctxt "ES10-0018"
msgid "{1}The pen is heavy as lead but glides almost without friction as you print your initials on the bottom of page after page of ominous legal documents and sign several dozen statements, notices, and agreements. The banker, a balding middle-aged man in a suit that you suspect costs more than the spaceship you are about to purchase, flips the pages past you quickly, uttering a curt, \"Sign here. Now here,\" as he points to each page. He moves swiftly, mechanically."
msgstr "{1}ペンは鉛のように重いのに、ほとんど抵抗なく滑り、不吉な法的書類の各ページの下部にイニシャルを書き込み、数十通もの陳述書、通知書、契約書に署名していきます。銀行員は頭の薄い中年男性で、着ているスーツはこれから購入する宇宙船より高価なのではと思うほどです。彼はあなたの前で素早くページをめくり、各ページを指さしながら「ここに署名。次はここ」とぶっきらぼうに言います。その動きは素早く、機械的です。"

#. [ES10-0019] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:84
msgctxt "ES10-0019"
msgid "{1}The only moment when he becomes truly animated is when explaining the Truth in Lending statement to you. \"You are borrowing 480,000 credits,\" he says, \"to be repaid over the course of one year. Your daily interest rate is 0.4%, which means that your daily payments are 2,503 credits, and by the end of the year you will have paid... 433,567 credits in interest. Sign here.\" He grins."
msgstr "{1}彼が本当に生き生きとするのは、融資条件開示書について説明する時だけです。「借入額は480,000クレジットです」と彼は言います。「1年間で返済していただきます。日利は0.4％ですから、毎日の返済額は2,503クレジットとなり、1年後には……利息を433,567クレジット支払うことになります。ここに署名を」彼はにやりと笑います。"

#. [ES10-0020] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:85
msgctxt "ES10-0020"
msgid "{1}You sign your name one final time:"
msgstr "{1}あなたは最後にもう一度署名します："

#. [ES10-0021] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:87
msgctxt "ES10-0021"
msgid "{1}The elevator is so well-tuned that you do not even realize it is moving until it has deposited you back in the lobby. But as you leave the bank, you are smiling. This crazy adventure suddenly feels real to you. You are going to do it. You are finally going to get off this planet."
msgstr "{1}エレベーターは非常にスムーズで、ロビーに戻るまで動いていることさえ気づきません。しかし、銀行を出る時、あなたは微笑んでいます。この無謀な冒険が突然現実味を帯びてきました。本当に実行するのです。ついにこの惑星を離れるのです。"

#. [ES10-0022] Scope: Core | Category: Starting scenario | Source context: conversation / default intro | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/starts.txt:88
msgctxt "ES10-0022"
msgid "{1}Compared to the bank, you feel much more at home in the shipyard, walking among the rusted out hulks and newer ships that gleam in the sunlight. You smell grease and dirt and rocket fuel; wonderful smells. There are three ship models within your price range. Which one you choose will determine your future..."
msgstr "{1}銀行と比べると、造船所の方がずっと落ち着きます。錆びついた古い船体や、日光を浴びて輝く新しい船の間を歩きます。グリースと土、ロケット燃料の匂いがします。素晴らしい匂いです。予算内で購入できる船のモデルは3つあります。どれを選ぶかがあなたの未来を決定します…"

