#. [ES10-0030] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [0] | Text role: substitution <while> | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Inserted fragment; review grammar in parent sentence. Key <while> remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:592
msgctxt "ES10-0030"
msgid "While they don't sell much here compared to on the big manufacturing worlds"
msgstr "彼らは、大規模な製造惑星と比べると、ここではあまり多くのものを販売していないが"

#. [ES10-0031] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [0] | Text role: log | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:598
msgctxt "ES10-0031"
msgid "Getting some basic instructions on making a living as a merchant from an old captain named James."
msgstr "ジェームズという名の老船長から、商人として生計を立てるための基本的な手ほどきを受ける。"

