#: data/human/intro missions.txt:849
msgctxt "ES10-0037"
msgid "When you meet up with James in the spaceport, he says, \"Hi there, {1}! I found you another mission, but it looks like you'll need {2} in order to take it on. So, you'll either have to cancel another mission, or come back here later to continue this one. Sorry!\""
msgstr "宇宙港でジェームズと落ち合うと、彼はこう言った。「やあ、{1}！また別の任務を見つけてきたよ。でも、それを受けるには{2}が必要みたいだ。だから、他の任務をキャンセルするか、後でまたここに来てこの任務を続ける必要があるね。すまない！」"

#. [ES10-0038] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:627
msgctxt "ES10-0038"
msgid "You begin strolling through the spaceport, walking briskly in order to keep warm and wondering if it might be worth investing in a good winter coat for visiting planets like this one. Eventually you find James. He has an entire family in tow: a young couple, an elderly woman, and three children who range in age from probably about three or four up to twelve or thirteen."
msgstr "あなたは宇宙港を歩き始めた。暖をとるために足早に歩きながら、このような惑星を訪れるために良い冬用コートに投資する価値があるかもしれないと考えた。やがてジェームズを見つけた。彼には、若い夫婦、老婦人、そしておそらく3、4歳から12、13歳くらいの3人の子供という、家族全員が同行していた。"

#. [ES10-0039] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
