#: data/human/intro missions.txt:628
msgctxt "ES10-0039"
msgid "{1}\"Captain {2}!\" he says. \"Wonderful to see you again. I was just talking to this family. They've been having trouble finding a single ship that can give them all passage, but I told them that your shuttlecraft has plenty of bunks, at least if the kids triple up. They can pay you {3} to take them to {4}, which is just a few jumps away from Earth, and is a planet well worth visiting in its own right. What do you say?\""
msgstr "{1}「{2}船長！」と彼は言う。「また会えてうれしいよ。ちょうどこの家族と話していたところなんだ。全員を一緒に乗せてくれる船がなかなか見つからなくて困っていたんだけど、君のシャトルには寝台が十分あると伝えたよ。少なくとも、子供たち3人が1つの寝台で寝ればね。{4}まで連れて行けば、報酬として{3}を払ってくれるそうだ。そこは地球から数回ジャンプしたところにあって、それ自体、訪れる価値のある惑星だよ。どうだい？」"

#. [ES10-0040] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:629
msgctxt "ES10-0040"
msgid "{1}You're absolutely sure that your shuttle was not designed to fit eight people including yourself, but if they're willing to squeeze into the available five bunks you've got no reason to discourage them."
msgstr "{1}あなたのシャトルが自分を含めて8人を乗せるようには設計されていないことは確実だが、彼らが5つの寝台に詰め込まれることを承知しているのなら、あえて断る理由はない。"

#. [ES10-0041] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:631
msgctxt "ES10-0041"
msgid "{1}\"Welcome aboard!\""
msgstr "{1}「ようこそ！」"

#. [ES10-0042] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:632
msgctxt "ES10-0042"
msgid "{1}\"Sorry, I think I'd rather go off in my own direction from here.\""
msgstr "{1}「ごめん、ここからは自分の道を行くことにするよ。」"

#. [ES10-0043] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:634
msgctxt "ES10-0043"
msgid "{1}James helps the older woman up the steps and into your ship while the younger family members carry the luggage. You are going to have quite a full ship for the next few days."
msgstr "{1}ジェームズは年配の女性が階段を上ってあなたの船に乗るのを手伝い、その間、若い家族たちは荷物を運ぶ。これから数日間、あなたの船はかなり満員になりそうだ。"

#. [ES10-0044] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet>; <origin> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:640
msgctxt "ES10-0044"
msgid "Along the journey, you learned that the family you are transporting are named the Hendersons, and that they are moving to {1} mostly because they hope the urban setting will be better for their kids than {2}, where there were hardly any children at all and their village had only a few thousand people in it. The grandmother, Olivia, has also been chattering nonstop about how excited she is about being on a world where she can actually go sunbathing: \"I've gotten much too old for snowshoeing,\" she says."
msgstr "旅の途中で、あなたは乗せている家族がヘンダーソン一家だと知った。一家が{1}へ引っ越すのは、主に都市部のほうが{2}よりも子供たちにとって良い環境になると期待しているからだ。には子供がほとんどおらず、一家が暮らしていた村の人口も数千人しかいなかった。祖母のオリビアも、実際に日光浴ができる惑星に行けるのがどれほど楽しみか、休みなくしゃべり続けている。「スノーシューをするには、もう年を取りすぎたわ」と彼女は言う。"

#. [ES10-0045] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <payment> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:641
msgctxt "ES10-0045"
msgid "{1}You say goodbye to them and wish them well, and as agreed they pay you {2}. You are already well on your way towards paying down your mortgage!"
msgstr "{1}あなたは彼らに別れを告げて幸運を祈り、約束どおり彼らはあなたに{2}を支払います。住宅ローンの返済も、すでに順調に進んでいます！"

#. [ES10-0046] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:642
msgctxt "ES10-0046"
msgid "{1}As James leaves the ship, he says, \"Again, if you're okay with continuing to give me a ride, just meet me in the spaceport.\""
msgstr "{1}ジェームズは船を降りる際、こう言います。「さっきも言ったけど、引き続き乗せてくれるなら、宇宙港で落ち合おう。」"

#. [ES10-0047] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0187] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: conversation "freighter 1 end" | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0293] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: conversation "mining intro end" | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:440
msgctxt "ES10-0047"
msgid "{1}(As before, click the \"Spaceport\" button to continue this mission.)"
msgstr "{1}（以前と同様に、「宇宙港」ボタンをクリックしてこのミッションを続けてください。）"

#. [ES10-0048] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:650
msgctxt "ES10-0048"
msgid "Tourists to {1}"
msgstr "{1}への観光客"

#. [ES10-0049] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <payment>; <destination> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:651
msgctxt "ES10-0049"
msgid "These tourists will pay you {1} to take them to {2}. Your new friend James will also be tagging along for the ride."
msgstr "これらの観光客は、{2}まで連れて行く対価としてあなたに{1}を支払います。新しい友人のジェームズも一緒に乗船します。"

#. [ES10-0051] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <origin>; <last>; <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:661
msgctxt "ES10-0051"
msgid "It doesn't take you long to find James in the {1} spaceport. He's already got a small group of people with him: a middle-aged couple, and a teenage boy. \"Hi there, Captain {2}!\" says James. \"Interested in carrying some tourists to {3}?\""
msgstr "{1}の宇宙港でジェームズはすぐに見つかります。彼はすでに、中年の夫婦と10代の少年を連れています。「やあ、{2}船長！」とジェームズが言います。「{3}まで観光客を乗せていかないかい？」"

#. [ES10-0052] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:663
msgctxt "ES10-0052"
msgid "{1}\"Sure!\""
msgstr "{1}「もちろんです！」"

#. [ES10-0053] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:664
msgctxt "ES10-0053"
msgid "{1}\"No thanks, I think I'll strike off on my own now.\""
msgstr "{1}「いいや、遠慮しておくよ。これからは一人でやっていこうと思う。」"

#. [ES10-0054] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:666
msgctxt "ES10-0054"
msgid "{1}\"Great,\" he says. \"This is Chuck, Sarah, and their son Carl. Let's help them carry their luggage to your ship.\" As you begin walking back, slightly ahead of them, James whispers to you, \"Tourists are always a good way to make money. They're on vacation, so they don't mind paying a bit extra. But no point in your cargo space going to waste, so take a look at the job board and see if there are any delivery missions we can run at the same time.\""
msgstr "{1}「よかった」と彼は言います。「こちらはチャックとサラ、それに二人の息子のカールだ。荷物を君の船まで運ぶのを手伝おう。」あなたが三人より少し先を歩き始めると、ジェームズがあなたにささやきます。「観光客はいつだっていい稼ぎ口だ。休暇中だから、少し多めに払うのも気にしない。でも、貨物スペースを遊ばせておくのはもったいない。仕事掲示板を見て、ついでにこなせる配送ミッションがないか確認してみるといい。」"

#. [ES10-0055] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:672
msgctxt "ES10-0055"
msgid "As you make the final landing descent to the surface of {1}, Chuck and Sarah stare out the window in rapt attention, pointing out landmarks on the planet's surface. James joins in by telling you all about some of the history of the cities you are flying over. Carl, meanwhile, has spent the entire journey playing a video game, and only glances out the window when the ship shakes from turbulence. As they all grab their luggage and step off your ship to explore humanity's homeworld, he is still immersed in the game."
msgstr "{1}の地表に向けて最終降下を始めると、チャックとサラは夢中で窓の外を見つめ、地表の目印となる場所を指差しています。ジェームズも加わり、眼下を通過する都市の歴史をいろいろと教えてくれます。一方カールは、旅の間ずっとビデオゲームをして過ごし、乱気流で船が揺れたときだけ窓の外をちらりと見ました。皆が荷物を手に取り、人類の母星を探索しようと船を降りるときも、彼はまだゲームに没頭しています。"

#. [ES10-0056] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:673
msgctxt "ES10-0056"
msgid "{1}As you collect your payment, James pulls the parents aside and says, \"Watch out for pickpockets, okay? And take it from an experienced captain, you do not want to be out after dark here. Play it safe, and have a great time.\""
msgstr "{1}あなたが報酬を受け取っている間、ジェームズは両親を脇に呼び寄せて言います。「スリには気をつけてくださいね。それと、経験豊富な船長からのアドバイスですが、ここでは暗くなってから出歩かないほうがいいですよ。安全第一で、楽しんできてください。」"

#. [ES10-0057] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Transport] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:674
msgctxt "ES10-0057"
msgid "{1}After they leave, James shakes his head ruefully. \"It'll probably be a decade before that kid is old enough to realize what he's missing out on. Waste of money, doing a trip like this with a teenage boy. They should've gone to Skymoot and seen the dragons instead; I'm sure that would interest him a lot more than historical museums and ancient cities.\" Then, he picks up his luggage and adds, \"Same deal as before. If you want to keep traveling together, meet me in the spaceport.\""
msgstr "{1}彼らが去った後、ジェームズは残念そうに首を振ります。「あの子が何を見逃しているのか気づくようになるまで、あと10年はかかるだろうな。10代の少年を連れてこんな旅行をするなんて、金の無駄だよ。スカイムートに行ってドラゴンでも見ればよかったんだ。歴史博物館や古代都市より、そのほうがずっと興味を引くだろうに。」それから彼は自分の荷物を手に取り、こう付け加えます。「前と同じだ。一緒に旅を続けたいなら、宇宙港で会おう。」"

#. [ES10-0058] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Transport] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0085] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Freighter] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0121] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Interceptor] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:903
msgctxt "ES10-0058"
msgid "Bring James to {1}"
msgstr "ジェームズを{1}へ連れて行く"

#. [ES10-0059] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Transport] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <destination> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:681
msgctxt "ES10-0059"
msgid "Bring James to {1}, where he has a spot reserved in a retirement home."
msgstr "ジェームズを、老人ホームに入居枠が確保されている{1}へ連れて行く。"

#. [ES10-0060] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Transport] | Text role: blocked | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0087] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Freighter] | Text role: blocked | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0123] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Interceptor] | Text role: blocked | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <first>; <capacity> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:905
msgctxt "ES10-0060"
msgid "When you meet up with James in the spaceport, he says, \"Hi there, {1}! I have one final mission for you, but you'll need {2} in order to take it on. So, you'll either have to cancel another mission, or come back here later to continue this one. Sorry!\""
msgstr "宇宙港でジェームズと落ち合うと、彼は言います。「やあ、{1}！最後に一つ頼みたいミッションがあるんだが、それを受けるには{2}が必要になる。だから、他のミッションをキャンセルするか、後でまたここに戻ってきてこのミッションを続ける必要があるんだ。すまない！」"

#. [ES10-0061] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Transport] | Text role: substitution <they've> | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Inserted fragment; review grammar in parent sentence. Key <they've> remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:689
msgctxt "ES10-0061"
msgid "you've"
msgstr "あなたは～した"

#. [ES10-0062] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Transport] | Text role: log | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:696
msgctxt "ES10-0062"
msgid "Dropped James off on Hestia after running a few missions with him. Met a few spoiled tourists and got to visit Earth along the way."
msgstr "ジェームズといくつかのミッションをこなした後、ヘスティアで彼を降ろした。途中で何人かのわがままな観光客に出会い、地球を訪れることもできた。"

#. [ES10-0065] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Transport] | Text role: logbook text | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0091] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Freighter] | Text role: logbook text | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0127] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Interceptor] | Text role: logbook text | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:918
msgctxt "ES10-0065"
msgid "He currently resides on Hestia, having retired from life as a merchant captain."
msgstr "彼は商船の船長を引退し、現在はヘスティアに住んでいる。"

#. [ES10-0066] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0106] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Interceptor] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:847
msgctxt "ES10-0066"
msgid "Delivery to {1}"
msgstr "{1}へ配送"

#. [ES10-0067] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <destination>; <cargo> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:705
msgctxt "ES10-0067"
msgid "Travel with your new friend James to {1}, and deliver {2}."
msgstr "新しい友人のジェームズと一緒に{1}へ旅をし、{2}を届けてください。"

#. [ES10-0069] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: mission cargo name | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Translate display only; retain canonical cargo key. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:707
msgctxt "ES10-0069"
msgid "vaccines"
msgstr "ワクチン"

#. [ES10-0070] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <origin>; <last>; <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:722
msgctxt "ES10-0070"
msgid "The spaceport on {1} is small enough that it doesn't take long to find James. He's talking with a man wearing what looks like a doctor's lab coat. \"Captain {2}!\" says James. \"Glad you could join us. It turns out there's been a flu outbreak on {3}, and they're asking every captain with space to spare to carry some vaccines and other medical supplies over there. Are you willing to help out?\""
msgstr "{1}の宇宙港は小さく、ジェームズを見つけるのに時間はかかりません。彼は医者の白衣のようなものを着た男性と話しています。「{2}船長！」とジェームズが言います。「会えてよかった。{3}でインフルエンザが流行していて、積荷を載せる余裕のある船長全員に、ワクチンやその他の医療物資を運んでほしいと頼まれているんだ。協力してくれないか？」"

#. [ES10-0071] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:724
msgctxt "ES10-0071"
msgid "{1}\"I'd be glad to help!\""
msgstr "{1}「喜んで協力します！」"

#. [ES10-0072] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:725
msgctxt "ES10-0072"
msgid "{1}\"Sorry, I've heard bad things about that region of space. I think I'm going to head in the other direction.\""
msgstr "{1}「すみませんが、その宙域については悪い噂を聞いています。私は別の方向へ向かおうと思います。」"

#. [ES10-0073] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Freighter] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:727
msgctxt "ES10-0073"
msgid "{1}\"Great!\" says James. \"They'll be loading up your ship shortly.\""
msgstr "{1}「素晴らしい！」とジェームズが言います。「すぐに君の船に積み込みを始めるよ。」"

#. [ES10-0074] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:738
msgctxt "ES10-0074"
msgid "Rush delivery to {1}"
msgstr "{1}への緊急配送"

#. [ES10-0075] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <commodity>; <destination>; <date> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:739
msgctxt "ES10-0075"
msgid "This shipment of {1} needs to get to {2}, by {3}."
msgstr "この{1}の貨物は、{3}までに{2}へ届ける必要があります。"

#. [ES10-0077] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: mission cargo name | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Translate display only; retain canonical cargo key. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:741
msgctxt "ES10-0077"
msgid "raw eel"
msgstr "生のウナギ"

#. [ES10-0078] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:751
msgctxt "ES10-0078"
msgid "As you walk through the spaceport, James sees you from a distance and waves you over. As you approach, the smell of raw fish overwhelms you. \"I've found another job for you,\" he says."
msgstr "宇宙港を歩いていると、遠くからジェームズがあなたを見つけて手招きしています。近づくと、生の魚の臭いが鼻をつきます。「また別の仕事を見つけたよ」と彼は言います。"

#. [ES10-0079] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:753
msgctxt "ES10-0079"
msgid "{1}\"Is it by any chance an unusually smelly job?\""
msgstr "{1}「もしかして、すごく臭う仕事ですか？」"

#. [ES10-0080] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:754
msgctxt "ES10-0080"
msgid "{1}\"Sorry, I think I'll head off on my own now.\""
msgstr "{1}「すみませんが、もう自分一人で行こうと思います。」"

#. [ES10-0081] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <cargo>; <planet>; <day> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:756
msgctxt "ES10-0081"
msgid "{1}\"It is indeed,\" he says, \"but a lucrative one. {2} needs to get to {3} while it's still fresh, and that means it needs to be there no later than {4}. If we take a direct route, there should be no trouble making the delivery on time. What do you say?\""
msgstr "{1}「その通りだ」と彼は言います。「だが、儲かる仕事だよ。{2}を新鮮なうちに{3}へ届ける必要がある。つまり、遅くとも{4}までには着かなければならない。直行ルートで行けば、時間通りに配達できるはずだ。どうだい？」"

#. [ES10-0082] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:758
msgctxt "ES10-0082"
msgid "{1}\"Sounds good. Let's do it!\""
msgstr "{1}「いいですね。やりましょう！」"

#. [ES10-0083] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:759
msgctxt "ES10-0083"
msgid "{1}\"No way am I loading up my shiny new starship with smelly fish. Count me out.\""
msgstr "{1}「ピカピカの新造宇宙船に臭い魚を積み込むなんて、とんでもない。この仕事はお断りします。」"

#. [ES10-0084] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Freighter] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:761
msgctxt "ES10-0084"
msgid "{1}\"Great!\" he says. \"I mentioned this earlier, but you might want to stop by the outfitter and buy a local map. Hyperspace routes aren't always logical, and the last thing you want to do is get lost and end up with a pile of rotten fish that no one wants filling up your cargo hold.\""
msgstr "{1}「素晴らしい！」と彼は言います。「前にも言ったが、装備屋に寄って現地の地図を買っておいたほうがいいかもしれない。ハイパースペースのルートは必ずしも論理的ではないからね。道に迷って、誰も欲しがらない腐った魚の山を貨物室に抱えることだけは避けたいだろう？」"

#. [ES10-0086] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Freighter] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0122] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Interceptor] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <destination> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:904
msgctxt "ES10-0086"
msgid "Drop James off on {1}, where he has a spot reserved in a retirement home."
msgstr "ジェームズを{1}で降ろす。そこにある老人ホームには、彼の入居枠が確保されている。"

#. [ES10-0088] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [3 Freighter] | Text role: log | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:786
msgctxt "ES10-0088"
msgid "Dropped James off on Hestia after running a few missions with him. Ship still smells like fish."
msgstr "ジェームズといくつかの任務をこなした後、ヘスティアで彼を降ろした。船はまだ魚臭い。"

#. [ES10-0092] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:794
msgctxt "ES10-0092"
msgid "Escort convoy to {1}"
msgstr "船団を{1}まで護衛する"

#. [ES10-0093] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <destination> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:795
msgctxt "ES10-0093"
msgid "Escort a merchant convoy to {1}, along with your new friend James."
msgstr "新しい友人ジェームズと共に、商船団を{1}まで護衛してください。"

#. [ES10-0095] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: NPC ship name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Given ship name, not model ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:815
msgctxt "ES10-0095"
msgid "Bloodletter"
msgstr "ブラッドレター"

