#: data/human/intro missions.txt:820
msgctxt "ES10-0097"
msgid "Horn of Plenty"
msgstr "豊穣の角"

#. [ES10-0098] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: NPC ship name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Given ship name, not model ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:821
msgctxt "ES10-0098"
msgid "Morning Light"
msgstr "モーニングライト"

