#: data/human/intro missions.txt:823
msgctxt "ES10-0099"
msgid "his"
msgstr "彼の"

#. [ES10-0100] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: substitution <they're> | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
