#: data/human/intro missions.txt:824
msgctxt "ES10-0100"
msgid "he's"
msgstr "彼は～だ"

#. [ES10-0101] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: substitution <they are> | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Inserted fragment; review grammar in parent sentence. Key <they are> remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:825
msgctxt "ES10-0101"
msgid "he is"
msgstr "彼は～である"

#. [ES10-0102] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:829
msgctxt "ES10-0102"
msgid "You find James standing on a landing pad underneath a large freighter, chatting with a man you assume is the captain. \"There you are!\" he says. \"Captain Eldred here says his two ships have been having trouble with pirates ever since they left the Rim ten days ago, and he's looking for an escort to get them safely to Gemstone. Are you interested?\""
msgstr "大型貨物船の下の着陸パッドで、船長と思われる男と話しているジェームズを見つけます。「いたいた！」と彼は言います。「ここのエルドレッド船長によると、10日前にリムを出発して以来、彼の2隻の船は海賊に悩まされているそうだ。それで、ジェムストーンまで安全に送り届けてくれる護衛を探しているんだ。興味はあるか？」"

#. [ES10-0103] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:831
msgctxt "ES10-0103"
msgid "{1}\"Of course!\""
msgstr "{1}「もちろんです！」"

#. [ES10-0104] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: choice | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:832
msgctxt "ES10-0104"
msgid "{1}\"No, sounds a bit too risky for me.\""
msgstr "{1}「いいえ、私には少し危険すぎる気がします。」"

#. [ES10-0105] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [1 Interceptor] | Text role: dialogue paragraph | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <planet> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:834
msgctxt "ES10-0105"
msgid "{1}\"Great,\" he says. \"Whenever we're ready to leave the planet, they'll take off behind us and follow us to {2}.\" As you begin walking away together, he adds in a quieter voice, \"Normally a fresh pilot like you with no combat reputation would never be offered a mission like this, so try not to mess things up. Remember that we don't have to kill the pirates, all we have to do is make sure the convoy isn't destroyed. But freighters are slow, so you can't just go skipping through hyperspace as fast as you want; you need to stick around and make sure they're behind you.\""
msgstr "{1}「よかった」と彼は言います。「この惑星を発つときは、彼らも我々の後から離陸して、{2}までついてくる。」一緒に歩き出すと、彼は声を潜めて付け加えます。「普通、君のような戦闘での実績がない新米パイロットには、こんな任務は回ってこない。だから、しくじらないでくれ。海賊を倒す必要はない。船団が破壊されないようにすればいいだけだ。だが、貨物船は遅い。好きなだけ速くハイパースペースを飛んで先へ行くわけにはいかない。船団のそばについて、ちゃんと後ろからついてきているか確かめてくれ。」"

#. [ES10-0107] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Interceptor] | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <commodity>; <destination> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:848
msgctxt "ES10-0107"
msgid "Deliver {1} to {2}, while avoiding pirate attacks."
msgstr "海賊の襲撃を避けながら、{1}を{2}へ届けてください。"

#. [ES10-0109] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Interceptor] | Text role: mission cargo name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Translate display only; retain canonical cargo key. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:851
msgctxt "ES10-0109"
msgid "gemstones"
msgstr "宝石"

#. [ES10-0110] Scope: Core | Category: James tutorial | Source context: Intro [2 Interceptor] | Text role: NPC ship name | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Given ship name, not model ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/intro missions.txt:859
msgctxt "ES10-0110"
msgid "Hammer of Thor"
msgstr "トールのハンマー"

