#. [ES10-0535] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help bank | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:15
msgctxt "ES10-0535"
msgid "This is the bank. Here, you can apply for new mortgages, if your income and credit history allows it. The bank is also a good place to get an overview of your daily expenses: mortgage payments, crew salaries, etc."
msgstr "ここは銀行です。ここでは、収入と信用履歴が許せば、新たなローンを申し込めます。銀行は、ローンの返済や乗組員の給与など、日々の支出を確認するのにも便利な場所です。"

#. [ES10-0536] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help bank | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:16
msgctxt "ES10-0536"
msgid "Paying off a mortgage early means you pay less interest to the bank, but it is sometimes wiser to instead use your money to buy a bigger ship which can earn you more income."
msgstr "ローンを早期に完済すれば銀行に支払う利息は減りますが、その資金でより大きな船を購入し、収入を増やす方が賢明な場合もあります。"

#. [ES10-0537] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help bank advanced | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:19
msgctxt "ES10-0537"
msgid "When entering a credit value at the bank, you can put in an exact number, or use the suffixes K, M, B, and T as shorthand for thousands, millions, billions, and trillions. For example, entering a value such as \"100k\" would count as 100,000 credits."
msgstr "銀行でクレジット額を入力する際は、正確な数値を入力するか、千、百万、十億、一兆を表す接尾辞K、M、B、Tを使って省略できます。例えば、「100k」と入力すると、100,000クレジットとして扱われます。"

#. [ES10-0538] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help bank advanced | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:20
msgctxt "ES10-0538"
msgid "Entering a number that is higher than what you or the bank have available will default to the maximum available value. For example, entering \"1m\" to pay off a 100,000 credit loan will completely pay off the loan without giving extra, should you have available credits."
msgstr "自分または銀行が用意できる額を超える数値を入力した場合は、利用可能な最大額が適用されます。例えば、100,000クレジットのローンの返済に「1m」と入力しても、十分なクレジットがあれば、余分に支払うことなくローンを完済できます。"

#. [ES10-0539] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help dead | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:23
msgctxt "ES10-0539"
msgid "Uh-oh! You just died. The universe can be a dangerous place for new captains!"
msgstr "大変！死んでしまいましたね。宇宙は新米船長にとって危険な場所になり得ます！"

#. [ES10-0540] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help dead | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Show main menu> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:24
msgctxt "ES10-0540"
msgid "Fortunately, your game is automatically saved every time you leave a planet. To load your most recent saved game, press {1} to return to the main menu, then click on \"Manage Pilots\" and \"Enter Ship.\""
msgstr "幸いなことに、ゲームは惑星を離れるたびに自動的にセーブされます。最新のセーブデータをロードするには、{1}を押してメインメニューに戻り、「パイロットの管理」、「船に乗り込む」の順にクリックしてください。"

#. [ES10-0541] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help disabled | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:27
msgctxt "ES10-0541"
msgid "Your ship just got disabled! Before an enemy ship finishes you off, you should find someone to help you."
msgstr "船が航行不能になりました！敵の船にとどめを刺される前に、誰かに助けを求めるべきです。"

#. [ES10-0542] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help disabled | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Select next ship>; <Talk to selected ship> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:28
msgctxt "ES10-0542"
msgid "Press {1} to cycle through all the ships in this system. When you have a friendly one selected, press {2} to hail it. You can then ask for help, and the ship will come over and patch you up."
msgstr "{1}を押すと、この星系内のすべての船を順番に選択できます。友好的な船を選択したら、{2}を押して通信してください。助けを求めれば、その船がやって来て修理してくれます。"

#. [ES10-0543] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help disabled | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:29
msgctxt "ES10-0543"
msgid "If the ship that disabled you is still hanging around, you might need to hail them first and bribe them to leave you alone."
msgstr "もしあなたを航行不能にした船がまだ近くにいるなら、先に通信して賄賂を渡し、立ち去ってもらう必要があるかもしれません。"

#. [ES10-0544] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help hiring | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:32
msgctxt "ES10-0544"
msgid "Hiring extra crew is only helpful if you plan on capturing enemy ships. Each crew member other than yourself is paid 100 credits per day. Larger ships require more than one crew member, but you will automatically hire the minimum number of crew when you buy those ships."
msgstr "乗組員を追加で雇うのは、敵の船を拿捕する計画がある場合にのみ役立ちます。自分以外の乗組員は1人につき1日100クレジットの給料が必要です。大型船には複数の乗組員が必要ですが、そうした船を購入する際には、最低限必要な人数の乗組員が自動的に雇われます。"

#. [ES10-0545] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help hiring | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:33
msgctxt "ES10-0545"
msgid "Crew members take up space that can otherwise be used for passengers."
msgstr "乗組員は、本来なら乗客のために使えるスペースを占有してしまいます。"

#. [ES10-0546] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help jobs | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:36
msgctxt "ES10-0546"
msgid "Taking on jobs is a safe way to earn money. Special missions are offered in the Spaceport; more mundane jobs are posted on the Job Board. Most special missions are only offered once: if you turn one down, it will not be offered to you again."
msgstr "仕事を引き受けるのは、安全にお金を稼ぐ方法です。特別なミッションは宇宙港で提供され、より日常的な仕事は求人掲示板に掲載されます。ほとんどの特別ミッションは一度しか提供されません。断ると、二度と提示されることはありません。"

#. [ES10-0547] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help jobs | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:37
msgctxt "ES10-0547"
msgid "The payment for a job depends on how far you must travel and how much you are carrying. Jobs that have a time limit pay extra, but you are paid nothing if you miss the deadline."
msgstr "仕事の報酬は、移動距離と積載量によって決まります。期限付きの仕事は報酬が上乗せされますが、期限を過ぎると報酬は一切支払われません。"

#. [ES10-0548] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help jobs | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:38
msgctxt "ES10-0548"
msgid "As you gain a reputation for skill in combat, new jobs will become available, including escorting convoys and bounty hunting."
msgstr "戦闘での腕前が評判になれば、船団の護衛や賞金稼ぎなど、新しい仕事が舞い込むようになります。"

#. [ES10-0549] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 1 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Initiate hyperspace jump>; <View star map> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:41
msgctxt "ES10-0549"
msgid "There's nothing out here. The only way to get to another star system is by jumping through hyperspace. Unless you are out of fuel, you can jump by pressing {1}. To select which system you want to jump to, bring up the map by pressing {2}."
msgstr "ここには何もありません。別の星系へ行く唯一の方法は、ハイパースペースを通ってジャンプすることです。燃料切れでない限り、{1}を押せばジャンプできます。ジャンプ先の星系を選択するには、{2}を押してマップを開いてください。"

#. [ES10-0550] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 1 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Show main menu> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:42
msgctxt "ES10-0550"
msgid "At any time, you can return to the main menu by pressing {1}. All the key controls can be viewed, and changed, in the Preferences."
msgstr "いつでも{1}を押せばメインメニューに戻れます。すべてのキー操作は「設定」で確認および変更が可能です。"

#. [ES10-0551] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 2 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Show main menu> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:45
msgctxt "ES10-0551"
msgid "You seem to be lost. The universe is a big and complicated place, and no one is going to hold your hand out here. You might want to review the key controls (press {1} to bring up the main menu, then click on \"Preferences\") to figure out what is going on. There is also a player's manual with much more information. To read it, go to endless-sky.github.io and click on \"Manual.\""
msgstr "迷子になったようですね。宇宙は広大で複雑な場所であり、誰も手を引いてはくれません。何が起きているのか把握するために、キー操作を確認することをお勧めします（{1}を押してメインメニューを開き、「設定」をクリックしてください）。より詳しい情報が載ったプレイヤーマニュアルもあります。読むには、endless-sky.github.ioにアクセスし、「Manual」をクリックしてください。"

#. [ES10-0552] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 3 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:48
msgctxt "ES10-0552"
msgid "The void between the stars is cold and empty. Your ship, a tiny oasis of warmth, drifts alone out here illuminated only by the distant light of cold, uncaring suns. The distances between the stars are vast, beyond what the human mind can grasp; you could spend your whole life drifting out here and never reach another star."
msgstr "星々の間の虚空は冷たく、何もない場所です。小さな温もりのオアシスであるあなたの船は、冷たく無関心な恒星の遠い光だけに照らされながら、たった一隻で漂っています。星々の間の距離は広大で、人間の理解を超えています。一生をかけて漂い続けても、別の星にたどり着くことはできないでしょう。"

#. [ES10-0553] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 3 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Initiate hyperspace jump> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:49
msgctxt "ES10-0553"
msgid "Or, you could press {1} to use your hyperdrive. It will get you there a whole lot faster."
msgstr "あるいは、{1}を押してハイパードライブを使うこともできます。それならずっと早く到着できますよ。"

#. [ES10-0554] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 4 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:52
msgctxt "ES10-0554"
msgid "Out here in the endless sky, you have the freedom to do whatever you want in your tiny new spaceship. Become the captain of a merchant fleet. Or a bounty hunter. Discover strange alien societies and powerful new technology."
msgstr "この果てしない空の下、あなたは手に入れたばかりの小さな宇宙船で、何をするのも自由です。商船隊の船長になるもよし、賞金稼ぎになるもよし。未知の異星社会や強力な新技術を発見しましょう。"

#. [ES10-0555] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 4 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <View star map>; <Initiate hyperspace jump> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:53
msgctxt "ES10-0555"
msgid "Or if you want, you can just keep drifting here in empty space. Unless you've been ignoring all these messages, you already know that you can jump to another star system by selecting it in the map (which you bring up by pressing {1}), then closing the map and pressing {2}."
msgstr "あるいは、このまま何もない宇宙空間を漂い続けることもできます。これらのメッセージを無視していなければ、マップで星系を選択し（{1}を押して開きます）、マップを閉じて{2}を押せば、別の星系へジャンプできることはもう知っていますよね。"

#. [ES10-0556] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 5 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:56
msgctxt "ES10-0556"
msgid "The hum of your ship's engine is the only sound you hear. As you have traveled farther and farther away from the center of this star system, even the occasional plink of micrometeorites against your hull has stopped. Deep space is utterly quiet and strangely beautiful. A different captain might grow bored out here, but you find yourself content and at peace."
msgstr "船のエンジンの唸り音だけが聞こえます。星系の中心から遠ざかるにつれ、時折聞こえていた船体に微小隕石が当たる音さえ止みました。深宇宙は静寂に包まれ、奇妙なほど美しい場所です。他の船長なら退屈してしまうかもしれませんが、あなたは満足し、穏やかな気持ちでいます。"

#. [ES10-0557] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 5 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:57
msgctxt "ES10-0557"
msgid "Or maybe you're just really, really bad at figuring out how to play this game."
msgstr "それとも、単にこのゲームの遊び方を理解するのが本当に、本当に苦手なだけでしょうか。"

#. [ES10-0558] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 6 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Show main menu>; <View star map>; <Initiate hyperspace jump> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:60
msgctxt "ES10-0558"
msgid "You slip deeper and deeper into the zen-like calm of outer space. The Tao which can be spoken is not the true Tao. The game that must be played is not the true game. You let go of all desire: your desire to press {1} and check the game's preferences to find out how to control your ship. The desire to view the other places you can travel to by pressing {2}. You release even the desire to press {3} and initiate a random hyperjump in whatever direction you are facing in. Enlightenment hovers on the edge of your consciousness, so close you can almost grasp it."
msgstr "あなたは宇宙の禅のような静寂の深みへと沈んでいきます。語りうる道は常の道にあらず。プレイすべきゲームは真のゲームにあらず。あなたはすべての欲望を手放します。{1}を押してゲームの設定を確認し、船の操作方法を知りたいという欲望。{2}を押して移動可能な他の場所を見たいという欲望。{3}を押して、向いている方向にランダムなハイパージャンプを開始したいという欲望さえも手放します。悟りが意識の淵に漂っており、あと少しで手が届きそうです。"

#. [ES10-0559] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 7 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:64
msgctxt "ES10-0559"
msgid "The void whispers its secret to your soul: outer space, it says, is not about lasers or explosions. It is not about fighting space pirates or saving the galaxy. No, the true message of the void is the utter loneliness you have found while drifting here: one tiny speck of warmth, insignificant compared to the vasty nothingness between the stars and the trillions upon trillions of souls of proud humans and inscrutable aliens whom you will never meet."
msgstr "虚無があなたの魂に秘密をささやきます。宇宙とは、レーザーや爆発のことではない、と。宇宙海賊との戦いや銀河を救うことでもない。そう、虚無が告げる真のメッセージは、あなたがここで漂流しながら見出した、この上ない孤独です。星々の間の広大な虚無と、あなたが決して出会うことのない誇り高き人類や不可解な異星人の数兆もの魂と比べれば、あなたは取るに足らない、ほんの小さな温もりの欠片に過ぎないのです。"

#. [ES10-0560] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help lost 7 | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:65
msgctxt "ES10-0560"
msgid "The inner voice urging you to do something, anything rather than just continuing to drift here, falls silent..."
msgstr "ただここで漂流し続けるのではなく、何でもいいから何かをしろと促していた内なる声が静まり返っていきます……"

#. [ES10-0561] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Initiate hyperspace jump> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:68
msgctxt "ES10-0561"
msgid "This map shows all the star systems you know about and the hyperspace links between them. You can use the map to plot a hyperspace course by clicking on the system you want to travel to. To initiate a jump to that system, close the map and press {1}."
msgstr "このマップには、あなたが知っているすべての星系と、それらをつなぐハイパースペースリンクが表示されます。マップを使用して、移動したい星系をクリックすることでハイパースペース航路を計画できます。その星系へのジャンプを開始するには、マップを閉じて{1}を押してください。"

#. [ES10-0562] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:69
msgctxt "ES10-0562"
msgid "You can also press F to search the map for a specific system or planet."
msgstr "また、Fキーを押すと、マップ上で特定の星系や惑星を検索できます。"

#. [ES10-0563] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:72
msgctxt "ES10-0563"
msgid "As you explore more of the galaxy, the star map will quickly become a very powerful tool. Clicking on a distant system will automatically plot the quickest route to it. You can Shift+click on systems to plot a route between them, or Control+click to select a system without setting a route to it."
msgstr "銀河を探索するにつれて、星図はすぐに非常に強力なツールとなります。遠くの星系をクリックすると、そこへの最短ルートが自動的に計画されます。星系をShift+クリックすると星系間のルートを計画でき、Control+クリックするとルートを設定せずにその星系を選択できます。"

#. [ES10-0564] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:73
msgctxt "ES10-0564"
msgid "There are many other useful modes the map can be set to. Click on one of the buttons in the lower right corner to learn more."
msgstr "マップには他にも便利なモードが多数用意されています。右下隅にあるボタンのいずれかをクリックして詳細を確認してください。"

#. [ES10-0565] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced ports | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:76
msgctxt "ES10-0565"
msgid "The ports panel shows you where systems with spaceports are, as well as a plethora of other information. Clicking on the name of the system, the government of the system, the lines under the name of each planet, or any trade commodity will color the map differently, the key to which can be seen on the right side of the screen."
msgstr "宇宙港パネルには、宇宙港がある星系や、その他多くの情報が表示されます。星系名、星系の政府、各惑星名の下の線、または取引商品をクリックすると、マップの表示色が変わり、その凡例は画面の右側に表示されます。"

#. [ES10-0566] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced ports | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:77
msgctxt "ES10-0566"
msgid "Clicking the name of a planet, or clicking on a planet in the orbit map on the right side of the screen, will show that planet's description if you have visited it already. Clicking a planet on the orbit map will also tell your autopilot to land on that planet after you have arrived at that system at the end of your jump path."
msgstr "惑星名をクリックするか、画面右側の軌道マップ上の惑星をクリックすると、すでに訪れたことのある惑星であればその説明が表示されます。軌道マップ上の惑星をクリックすると、ジャンプ経路の終点であるその星系に到着した後、その惑星に着陸するようにオートパイロットに指示することもできます。"

#. [ES10-0567] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced ports | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:78
msgctxt "ES10-0567"
msgid "Right-clicking on a location in the orbit map will send your escorts to that location in the selected system."
msgstr "軌道マップ上の場所を右クリックすると、選択した星系のその場所に護衛艦を派遣できます。"

#. [ES10-0568] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced shops | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:81
msgctxt "ES10-0568"
msgid "The shipyard and outfitter map panels respectively display the ships and outfits sold on any planets that you have seen. Ships and outfits are displayed in categories which can be collapsed by clicking on the category name. Using Shift+click on a category name will collapse or uncollapse all the categories at once."
msgstr "造船所と装備屋のマップパネルには、これまでに見た惑星で販売されている宇宙船や装備がそれぞれ表示されます。宇宙船や装備はカテゴリー別に表示され、カテゴリー名をクリックすることで折りたたむことができます。カテゴリー名をShift+クリックすると、すべてのカテゴリーを一括で折りたたんだり、展開したりできます。"

#. [ES10-0569] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced shops | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:82
msgctxt "ES10-0569"
msgid "Each ship or outfit can be clicked on, displaying that item's stats while also highlighting any planets where it is sold. Using Shift+click on a ship or outfit after you already have one selected will display that item's stats side by side with the previously selected item."
msgstr "各宇宙船や装備をクリックすると、そのアイテムのステータスが表示され、同時にそれが販売されている惑星が強調表示されます。すでにアイテムを選択した状態で別の宇宙船や装備をShift+クリックすると、そのアイテムのステータスが先ほど選択したアイテムと並べて表示されます。"

#. [ES10-0570] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced shops | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:83
msgctxt "ES10-0570"
msgid "You can also press F to search the shipyard and outfitter maps for a specific ship or outfit."
msgstr "また、Fキーを押すと、造船所や装備屋のマップで特定の宇宙船や装備を検索できます。"

#. [ES10-0571] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced stars | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:86
msgctxt "ES10-0571"
msgid "The starry map mode displays the stars on the system map. This can also be enabled by pressing T. The stars present in a system affect the amount of solar power and solar wind available for use by solar collectors and ramscoops respectively."
msgstr "星図モードでは、星系マップ上に恒星が表示されます。これはTキーを押すことでも有効にできます。星系内に存在する恒星は、ソーラーコレクターやラムスクープがそれぞれ利用できる太陽光発電量や太陽風の量に影響を与えます。"

#. [ES10-0572] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help map advanced danger | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:89
msgctxt "ES10-0572"
msgid "The galaxy can be a dangerous place! Pirates raid some systems more frequently or in greater strength than others, and a poorly defended convoy risks attracting them in many systems. To get an idea of the relative danger of different systems, click on the alert icon next to the system name."
msgstr "銀河は危険な場所となり得ます！一部の星系では、他の星系よりも海賊が頻繁に、あるいは大規模に襲撃してきます。防衛が不十分な船団は、多くの星系で海賊を引き寄せる危険があります。各星系の相対的な危険度を知るには、星系名の横にある警告アイコンをクリックしてください。"

#. [ES10-0573] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help player info | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:99
msgctxt "ES10-0573"
msgid "The player info panel contains a wide variety of information about your pilot, including their net worth, combat rating, salary, and licenses."
msgstr "プレイヤー情報パネルには、純資産、戦闘評価、給与、ライセンスなど、あなたのパイロットに関する多種多様な情報が含まれています。"

#. [ES10-0574] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help player info | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:100
msgctxt "ES10-0574"
msgid "It also contains a list of all ships you currently own. Clicking on a ship and then going to the ship info tab, or double clicking on it, will bring up more information about that ship."
msgstr "また、現在所有しているすべての宇宙船のリストも含まれています。宇宙船をクリックして「宇宙船情報」タブに移動するか、ダブルクリックすると、その宇宙船に関する詳細情報が表示されます。"

#. [ES10-0575] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help player info | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:101
msgctxt "ES10-0575"
msgid "Your pilot's logbook and current missions can be accessed by clicking on the buttons below the panel."
msgstr "パイロットの飛行日誌と現在のミッションには、パネルの下にあるボタンをクリックしてアクセスできます。"

#. [ES10-0576] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help player info | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <View player info> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:102
msgctxt "ES10-0576"
msgid "The player info panel can be brought up at any time by pressing {1}, including mid-flight. However, some functionalities of the panel can only be accessed while landed."
msgstr "プレイヤー情報パネルは、飛行中を含め、いつでも{1}を押すことで表示できます。ただし、パネルの一部の機能には着陸中にしかアクセスできません。"

#. [ES10-0577] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help ship info | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:109
msgctxt "ES10-0577"
msgid "The ship info tab lets you view detailed information about ships in your fleet at any time. This includes any information you could see at a shipyard or outfitter, as well as the cargo and passengers distributed among each ship."
msgstr "「宇宙船情報」タブでは、艦隊内の宇宙船に関する詳細情報をいつでも確認できます。これには、造船所や装備屋で確認できる情報のほか、各宇宙船に割り当てられた貨物や乗客の情報も含まれます。"

#. [ES10-0578] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help ship info | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:110
msgctxt "ES10-0578"
msgid "Ships can be renamed in this panel by clicking on the ship's name. While landed on a planet, you are able to change how guns and turrets are arranged by dragging the name of a weapon to another gun or turret location. While in flight, you are able to jettison individual pieces of cargo by clicking on the name of the cargo."
msgstr "このパネルでは、宇宙船の名前をクリックすることで名前を変更できます。惑星に着陸している間は、武器の名前を別の固定砲や砲塔の取り付け位置にドラッグすることで、固定砲や砲塔の配置を変更できます。飛行中は、貨物の名前をクリックすることで、個々の貨物を投棄できます。"

#. [ES10-0579] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help navigation | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <View star map>; <Initiate hyperspace jump> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:150
msgctxt "ES10-0579"
msgid "Welcome to the sky! To travel to another star system, press {1} to view your map, and click on the system you want to travel to. Your hyperdrive can only travel along the \"links\" shown on your map. After selecting a destination, close your map and press {2} to jump to that system."
msgstr "空へようこそ！別の星系へ移動するには、{1}を押してマップを表示し、移動したい星系をクリックしてください。ハイパードライブはマップに表示されている「リンク」に沿ってのみ移動できます。目的地を選択したら、マップを閉じて{2}を押し、その星系へジャンプしてください。"

#. [ES10-0580] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help navigation | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:151
msgctxt "ES10-0580"
msgid "Your ship does not jump until you release the jump key. Once you have escorts, you can hold the key to get them ready to jump, then release it to have them all jump simultaneously."
msgstr "ジャンプキーを離すまで、宇宙船はジャンプしません。護衛艦がいる場合は、キーを押し続けることでジャンプの準備をさせ、キーを離すことで護衛艦を一斉にジャンプさせることができます。"

#. [ES10-0581] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help navigation | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Land on planet / station> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:152
msgctxt "ES10-0581"
msgid "When you reach a new system, you can press {1} to land on any inhabited planets that are there."
msgstr "新しい星系に到着したら、{1}を押すことで、その星系にある人が住んでいる惑星に着陸できます。"

#. [ES10-0582] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help navigation | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:153
msgctxt "ES10-0582"
msgid "Also, don't worry about crashing into asteroids or other ships; your ship will fly safely below or above them."
msgstr "また、小惑星や他の宇宙船との衝突を心配する必要はありません。あなたの宇宙船は、それらの下や上を安全に飛行します。"

#. [ES10-0583] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help outfitter | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:156
msgctxt "ES10-0583"
msgid "Here, you can buy new equipment for your ship. Your ship has a limited amount of \"outfit space,\" and most outfits use up some of that space."
msgstr "ここでは、宇宙船用の新しい装備を購入できます。宇宙船には「装備スペース」に限りがあり、ほとんどの装備はそのスペースの一部を消費します。"

#. [ES10-0584] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help outfitter | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:157
msgctxt "ES10-0584"
msgid "Some types of outfits have other requirements as well. For example, only some of your outfit space can be used for engines or weapons; this is your ship's \"engine capacity\" and \"weapon capacity.\" Guns and missile launchers also require a free \"gun port,\" and turrets require a free \"turret mount.\" Also, missiles can only be bought if you have the right launcher installed."
msgstr "装備の種類によっては、他の要件もあります。例えば、装備スペースの一部しかエンジンや武器に使用できません。これは宇宙船の「エンジン容量」および「武器容量」です。固定砲やミサイルランチャーには空の「ガンポート」が必要であり、砲塔には空の「タレットマウント」が必要です。また、ミサイルは適切なランチャーを搭載している場合にのみ購入できます。"

#. [ES10-0585] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help outfitter | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. [ES10-0589] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help shipyard | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:164
msgctxt "ES10-0585"
msgid "Use your scroll wheel or click and drag, to scroll the view."
msgstr "マウスホイールを使用するか、クリックしてドラッグすることで、表示をスクロールできます。"

#. [ES10-0586] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help outfitter | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:159
msgctxt "ES10-0586"
msgid "As in the trading and shipyard panels, you can hold down Shift, Control, or Alt to buy, sell, or move 5, 20, or 500 of an outfit at once, or multiple keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "取引パネルや造船所パネルと同様に、Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作することで、一度に5個、20個、または500個の装備を購入、売却、移動できます。複数のキーを組み合わせると、より多くの数を一度に操作できます。"

#. [ES10-0587] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help outfitter | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:160
msgctxt "ES10-0587"
msgid "You can also press F to search the outfitter for a specific item."
msgstr "また、Fキーを押すと、装備屋で特定のアイテムを検索できます。"

#. [ES10-0588] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help shipyard | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:163
msgctxt "ES10-0588"
msgid "Here, you can buy new ships."
msgstr "ここでは、新しい宇宙船を購入できます。"

#. [ES10-0590] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help shipyard | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:165
msgctxt "ES10-0590"
msgid "As in the trading and outfitter panels, you can hold down Shift, Control, or Alt to buy 5, 20, or 500 ships at once, or multiple keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "取引パネルや装備屋のパネルと同様に、Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作することで、一度に5隻、20隻、または500隻の宇宙船を購入できます。複数のキーを組み合わせると、より多くの数を一度に購入できます。"

#. [ES10-0591] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help shipyard | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:166
msgctxt "ES10-0591"
msgid "You can use the shortcuts B to Buy, S to Sell the ship and outfits, and R to sell the ship and retain the outfits if the planet has an outfitter."
msgstr "ショートカットキーとして、Bで「購入」、Sで「宇宙船と装備の売却」、Rで「宇宙船を売却して装備を保持（惑星に装備屋がある場合）」が使用できます。"

#. [ES10-0592] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help shipyard | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:167
msgctxt "ES10-0592"
msgid "You can also press F to search the shipyard for a specific ship."
msgstr "また、Fキーを押すと、造船所で特定の宇宙船を検索できます。"

#. [ES10-0593] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:170
msgctxt "ES10-0593"
msgid "Sometimes you may want to buy outfits directly into your cargo hold instead of having them installed."
msgstr "装備を取り付けずに、購入した装備を直接貨物室に入れたい場合もあります。"

#. [ES10-0594] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:171
msgctxt "ES10-0594"
msgid "You can use the following keyboard shortcuts or the buttons to move outfits around:"
msgstr "以下のキーボードショートカットまたはボタンを使用して、装備を移動できます。"

#. [ES10-0595] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:172
msgctxt "ES10-0595"
msgid "- \"B\" to buy and install outfits"
msgstr "- 「B」：装備を購入して取り付ける"

#. [ES10-0596] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:173
msgctxt "ES10-0596"
msgid "- \"S\" to sell outfits from cargo, planetary storage, or your ship (in that order)"
msgstr "- 「S」：貨物室、惑星の保管庫、宇宙船の順に装備を売却する"

#. [ES10-0597] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:174
msgctxt "ES10-0597"
msgid "- \"I\" to install outfits from cargo and/or storage (in that order)"
msgstr "- 「I」：貨物室や惑星の保管庫から、この順に装備を取り付ける"

#. [ES10-0598] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:175
msgctxt "ES10-0598"
msgid "- \"U\" to uninstall outfits from your ship and leave them in planetary storage, or unload outfits from cargo to planetary storage (in that order)"
msgstr "- 「U」：宇宙船から装備を取り外して惑星の保管庫に入れるか、貨物室から惑星の保管庫に装備を降ろす（この順序で）"

#. [ES10-0599] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:176
msgctxt "ES10-0599"
msgid "- \"C\" to move outfits from planetary storage and/or the outfitter (after paying) and move them into cargo"
msgstr "- 「C」：惑星の保管庫から装備を移すか、装備屋で購入して貨物室に入れる"

#. [ES10-0600] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:177
msgctxt "ES10-0600"
msgid "- \"R\" to move outfits from your cargo hold (if any are there) or else to uninstall to planetary storage"
msgstr "- 「R」：貨物室に装備があれば宇宙船に取り付け、なければ宇宙船から装備を取り外して惑星の保管庫に入れる"

#. [ES10-0601] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help cargo management | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:178
msgctxt "ES10-0601"
msgid "Outfits that are in your cargo hold can be installed at any outfitter without cost."
msgstr "貨物室にある装備は、どの装備屋でも無料で取り付けられます。"

#. [ES10-0602] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help uninstalling and storage | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:181
msgctxt "ES10-0602"
msgid "Using planetary storage can be useful for if you want to shuffle outfits between ships, store outfits for future use, or simply try different outfits."
msgstr "惑星の保管庫は、宇宙船の間で装備を入れ替えたり、後で使うために保管したり、別の装備を試したりする際に便利です。"

#. [ES10-0603] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help uninstalling and storage | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:182
msgctxt "ES10-0603"
msgid "Outfits that are in planetary storage or cargo can be installed without cost."
msgstr "惑星の保管庫や貨物室にある装備は、無料で取り付けられます。"

#. [ES10-0604] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help uninstalling and storage | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:183
msgctxt "ES10-0604"
msgid "If you sell an outfit at an outfitter, then you can immediately buy it back for the same price that you sold it, so long as you do not leave the planet."
msgstr "装備屋で装備を売却した場合、その惑星を離れない限り、売却時と同じ価格ですぐに買い戻せます。"

#. [ES10-0605] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help uninstalling and storage | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:184
msgctxt "ES10-0605"
msgid "This means that you do not necessarily need to worry about uninstalling outfits into planetary storage when you are changing outfits around."
msgstr "つまり、装備を入れ替える際に、必ずしも取り外した装備を惑星の保管庫に入れる必要はありません。"

#. [ES10-0606] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help stranded | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:193
msgctxt "ES10-0606"
msgid "Oops! You just ran out of fuel in an uninhabited star system. Fortunately, other ships are willing to help you."
msgstr "おっと！無人の星系で燃料が切れてしまいました。幸いなことに、他の船が助けてくれるでしょう。"

#. [ES10-0607] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help stranded | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Select next ship>; <Talk to selected ship> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:194
msgctxt "ES10-0607"
msgid "Press {1} to cycle through all the ships in this system. When you have a friendly one selected, press {2} to hail it. You can then ask for help, and if it has fuel to spare it will fly over and transfer fuel to your ship. This is easiest for the other ship to do if your ship is nearly stationary."
msgstr "{1}を押して、この星系内のすべての船を切り替えて選択します。友好的な船を選択したら、{2}を押して通信を試みます。助けを求めれば、もし相手に余分な燃料があれば、こちらまで飛んできて燃料を補給してくれます。自分の船がほぼ静止している状態だと、相手の船は補給しやすくなります。"

#. [ES10-0608] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help trading | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <View star map> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:197
msgctxt "ES10-0608"
msgid "This is the trading panel. Earn money by buying commodities at a low price in one system, and selling at a higher price elsewhere. To view your map of commodity prices in other systems, press {1}. To buy or sell, click on [buy] or [sell], or select a line with the up and down arrows and press \"+\" or \"-\" (or Enter and Delete)."
msgstr "ここは取引パネルです。ある星系で商品を安く買い、別の場所で高く売ることで利益を得られます。他の星系の商品価格マップを表示するには、{1}を押してください。売買するには、[買う]または[売る]をクリックするか、上下の矢印キーで項目を選択して「+」または「-」（あるいはEnterキーとDeleteキー）を押してください。"

#. [ES10-0609] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help trading | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:198
msgctxt "ES10-0609"
msgid "You can buy 5 tons at once by holding down Shift, 20 by holding down Control, 500 by holding down Alt, or larger amounts at a time by holding down two keys at once, or even all three."
msgstr "Shiftキーを押しながらだと一度に5トン、Controlキーなら20トン、Altキーなら500トン購入できます。2つのキーを同時に押せばより多くの量を、3つすべてを押せばさらに大量に一度で購入できます。"

#. [ES10-0610] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help trading | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:199
msgctxt "ES10-0610"
msgid "Sell other items in your cargo hold with the buttons to the left. \"Sell Minables\" sells materials mined from asteroids and other space debris. \"Sell Outfits\" sells all the other outfits present in cargo hold."
msgstr "左側のボタンで貨物室にある他のアイテムを売却できます。「採掘物を売却」は小惑星や宇宙の残骸から採掘した素材を売却します。「装備品を売却」は貨物室にあるその他の装備をすべて売却します。"

#. [ES10-0611] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help friendly disabled | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Board selected ship> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:202
msgctxt "ES10-0611"
msgid "This ship is disabled and needs your help to patch them up! Pressing {1} will fly you to their ship and get them up and running again. Just be sure to do it when no one is trying to kill you, or they could get caught in the crossfire!"
msgstr "この船は航行不能になっており、修理の助けを必要としています！{1}を押すと、相手の船まで飛行して修理を行い、再び動けるようにします。誰かに命を狙われていない時に行うようにしてください。さもないと、相手の船が巻き添えを食らう可能性があります！"

#. [ES10-0612] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:205
msgctxt "ES10-0612"
msgid "You've enabled controlling your ship with your mouse."
msgstr "マウスで船を操作する設定が有効になりました。"

#. [ES10-0613] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:207
msgctxt "ES10-0613"
msgid "The nose of your ship will always turn toward your mouse pointer."
msgstr "船の機首は常にマウスカーソルの方向を向きます。"

#. [ES10-0614] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Forward thrust> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:208
msgctxt "ES10-0614"
msgid "{1} is used to thrust forward."
msgstr "{1}は前進するために使用します。"

#. [ES10-0615] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Reverse> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:209
msgctxt "ES10-0615"
msgid "{1} is used to thrust reverse."
msgstr "{1}は後退するために使用します。"

#. [ES10-0616] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:210
msgctxt "ES10-0616"
msgid "Right mouse click will fire primary weapons."
msgstr "右クリックでメインウェポンを発射します。"

#. [ES10-0617] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve substitution tokens exactly; translate template before substitution. Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Tokens to preserve: <Mouse turning (hold)> (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:211
msgctxt "ES10-0617"
msgid "{1} will toggle mouse turning while it is held."
msgstr "{1}を押している間、マウスによる旋回のオン・オフが切り替わります。"

#. [ES10-0618] Scope: Optional | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: help control ship with mouse | Text role: help paragraph | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Preserve runtime command/keybinding tokens. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/help.txt:212
msgctxt "ES10-0618"
msgid "The \"go to and hold\" command is remapped from the right mouse button to the middle one."
msgstr "「移動して待機」コマンドの割り当ては、マウスの右ボタンから中央ボタンに変更されました。"

#. [ES10-0619] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Shuttle | Text role: ship display fallback | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Translate display only, not model ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3650
msgctxt "ES10-0619"
msgid "Shuttle"
msgstr "シャトル"

#. [ES10-0620] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Shuttle | Text role: category | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3658
msgctxt "ES10-0620"
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "輸送船"

#. [ES10-0621] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Shuttle | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3692
msgctxt "ES10-0621"
msgid "Although Betelgeuse Shipyards produces other ship models as well, the majority of their profits come from sales of the Shuttle. This versatile ship serves equally well as a passenger transport or a cargo courier. It also happens to be the cheapest ship you can buy which is capable of hyperspace travel."
msgstr "ベテルギウス造船所は他のモデルの船も製造していますが、利益の大半はシャトルの販売によるものです。この多目的船は、旅客輸送船としても貨物運搬船としても同様に優れた性能を発揮します。また、ハイパースペース航行が可能な船の中で、最も安価に購入できる船でもあります。"

#. [ES10-0622] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Shuttle | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3693
msgctxt "ES10-0622"
msgid "{1}Shuttles are not designed to withstand combat of any sort, but they are fast and maneuverable enough to get out of harm's way if attacked by a larger, slower ship. Although they are typically unarmed, they have enough space for one weapon, which is the origin of the popular phrase, \"as useless as a blaster cannon on a shuttlecraft.\""
msgstr "{1}シャトルはあらゆる種類の戦闘に耐えられるようには設計されていませんが、より大型で低速な船に攻撃された場合でも、危険を回避できるだけの速度と機動性を備えています。通常は非武装ですが、武器を1つ搭載するスペースはあり、それが「シャトルにブラスターキャノンを積むくらい無意味」という有名なフレーズの由来となっています。"

#. [ES10-0623] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Sparrow | Text role: ship display fallback | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Translate display only, not model ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3774
msgctxt "ES10-0623"
msgid "Sparrow"
msgstr "スパロー"

#. [ES10-0624] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Sparrow | Text role: category | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3779
msgctxt "ES10-0624"
msgid "Interceptor"
msgstr "迎撃機"

#. [ES10-0625] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Sparrow | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3818
msgctxt "ES10-0625"
msgid "Classified as an interceptor rather than a fighter because it has its own hyperdrive instead of needing to be carried inside a larger ship, the Tarazed Sparrow is the smallest and cheapest combat ship available. Because of its limited cargo and passenger space, the primary way for a Sparrow pilot to pay the bills is to upgrade the weapons and hunt pirates... or become one. In either case, it is a perilous way to earn a living."
msgstr "大型船に搭載される必要がなく、独自のハイパードライブを備えているため、戦闘機ではなく迎撃機に分類されるタラゼド・スパローは、入手可能な中で最も小型かつ安価な戦闘艦です。貨物や乗客の収容スペースが限られているため、スパローのパイロットが稼ぐ主な方法は、武器をアップグレードして海賊を狩るか……あるいは自らが海賊になることです。いずれにせよ、それは危険な稼業です。"

#. [ES10-0626] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Sparrow | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3819
msgctxt "ES10-0626"
msgid "{1}Government reports indicate that as many as two out of every three first-time ship buyers who choose to pilot a Sparrow lose their ship (and often, their life as well) within the first month of owning it. Pilots who have survived longer than that tend to swear by replacing the stock weapons with missile launchers."
msgstr "{1}政府の報告によると、初めて船を購入してスパローの操縦を選択した人のうち、最大で3人に2人が所有から1ヶ月以内に船を（そして多くの場合、命までも）失っています。それ以上の期間を生き延びたパイロットは、標準装備の武器をミサイルランチャーに換装することを強く推奨する傾向があります。"

#. [ES10-0627] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Star Barge | Text role: ship display fallback | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Translate display only, not model ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3882
msgctxt "ES10-0627"
msgid "Star Barge"
msgstr "スターバージ"

#. [ES10-0628] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Star Barge | Text role: category | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3887
msgctxt "ES10-0628"
msgid "Light Freighter"
msgstr "軽貨物船"

#. [ES10-0629] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Star Barge | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3923
msgctxt "ES10-0629"
msgid "The Syndicate CT-50 Star Barge is little more than a cluster of cargo containers with an engine at one end and a cockpit on the other. It is a slow and ugly ship, but it can carry enough cargo to earn its captain a steady income even in parts of the galaxy where it is hard to find passengers to carry or courier missions."
msgstr "シンジケートCT-50スターバージは、片端にエンジン、もう片端にコックピットを備えた貨物コンテナの集合体に過ぎません。遅くて見栄えの悪い船ですが、運ぶ乗客や配送任務を見つけるのが難しい銀河の地域でも、船長が安定した収入を得られるだけの貨物を運ぶことができます。"

#. [ES10-0630] Scope: Core | Category: Starter ships | Source context: Star Barge | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/human/ships.txt:3924
msgctxt "ES10-0630"
msgid "{1}Because they often carry valuable cargo, and because they are too slow to evade any attackers, Star Barges are a common target of pirates."
msgstr "{1}貴重な貨物を積んでいることが多く、攻撃を回避するにはあまりに低速であるため、スターバージは海賊の格好の標的となります。"

#. [ES10-0631] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip bunks: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:82
msgctxt "ES10-0631"
msgid "The number of people (passengers or crew) your ship can hold."
msgstr "あなたの船に収容可能な人数（乗客または乗組員）。"

#. [ES10-0632] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip cargo space: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:124
msgctxt "ES10-0632"
msgid "Tons of cargo (commodities, mission cargo, and plundered outfits) this ship can carry."
msgstr "この船が積載可能な貨物（商品、任務用貨物、略奪した装備品）のトン数。"

#. [ES10-0633] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip cost: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:196
msgctxt "ES10-0633"
msgid "Cost, in credits. If you have sold any used (depreciated) items today, you can buy them back for the same price you sold them for."
msgstr "コスト（クレジット単位）。今日、減価した中古アイテムを売却した場合、売却時と同じ価格で買い戻すことができます。"

#. [ES10-0634] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip hull: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:310
msgctxt "ES10-0634"
msgid "Total hull strength. Ships with a higher hull strength are able to take more damage as a proportion of their total strength before being disabled; the smallest of ships are disabled when their hull strength drops below about 45%, while very large ships are disabled at close to 10%."
msgstr "船体強度の合計。船体強度が高い船ほど、無力化されるまでに合計強度のうちより大きな割合のダメージに耐えることができます。最小の船は約45%を下回ると無力化されますが、非常に大型の船は10%近くで無力化されます。"

#. [ES10-0635] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip mass: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:493
msgctxt "ES10-0635"
msgid "Mass, in tons. A ship's mass determines how fast it turns and accelerates and its maximum heat before overheating."
msgstr "質量（トン単位）。船の質量は、旋回速度、加速性能、およびオーバーヒートするまでの最大熱量を決定します。"

#. [ES10-0636] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip required crew: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:568
msgctxt "ES10-0636"
msgid "Changes the number of crew members this ship requires by this amount."
msgstr "この船に必要な乗組員の数を、この値だけ変更します。"

#. [ES10-0637] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip shields: | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:679
msgctxt "ES10-0637"
msgid "Total shield strength. Most weapons cannot damage your hull until your shields are depleted. Some weapon effects, such as heat damage, become more severe once shields are down."
msgstr "シールドの合計強度です。ほとんどの武器は、シールドが枯渇するまで船体にダメージを与えることができません。熱ダメージのような一部の武器効果は、シールドがダウンするとより深刻になります。"

#. [ES10-0638] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: b | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:869
msgctxt "ES10-0638"
msgid "Buy from the outfitter and install onto the currently selected ship(s)."
msgstr "装備屋から購入し、現在選択中の船にインストールします。"

#. [ES10-0639] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: b | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:870
msgctxt "ES10-0639"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to buy 5, 20, or 500 outfits at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500個の装備を購入できます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの装備を購入できます。"

#. [ES10-0640] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: s | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:873
msgctxt "ES10-0640"
msgid "Sell from cargo, storage, or the currently selected ship(s), in that order."
msgstr "貨物、保管庫、または現在選択中の船から、この順序で売却します。"

#. [ES10-0641] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: s | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:874
msgctxt "ES10-0641"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to sell 5, 20, or 500 outfits at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500個の装備を売却できます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの装備を売却できます。"

#. [ES10-0642] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: i | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:877
msgctxt "ES10-0642"
msgid "Install on the currently selected ship(s) from cargo or storage, in that order."
msgstr "貨物または保管庫から、この順序で現在選択中の船にインストールします。"

#. [ES10-0643] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: i | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:878
msgctxt "ES10-0643"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to install 5, 20, or 500 outfits at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500個の装備をインストールできます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの装備をインストールできます。"

#. [ES10-0644] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: u | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:881
msgctxt "ES10-0644"
msgid "Uninstall from the currently selected ship(s) to cargo if there is space or to storage if there isn't."
msgstr "現在選択中の船からアンインストールします。スペースがあれば貨物へ、なければ保管庫へ移動します。"

#. [ES10-0645] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: u | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:882
msgctxt "ES10-0645"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to uninstall 5, 20, or 500 outfits at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500個の装備をアンインストールできます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの装備をアンインストールできます。"

#. [ES10-0646] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: c | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:885
msgctxt "ES10-0646"
msgid "Transfer the outfit from planetary storage to cargo if possible. Otherwise, buy it from the outfitter."
msgstr "可能であれば、惑星の保管庫から貨物へ装備を転送します。それができない場合は、装備屋から購入します。"

#. [ES10-0647] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: c | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:886
msgctxt "ES10-0647"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to move 5, 20, or 500 outfits at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500個の装備を移動できます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの装備を移動できます。"

#. [ES10-0648] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: r | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:889
msgctxt "ES10-0648"
msgid "Move the outfit from cargo, the currently selected ship(s), or the outfitter into planetary storage, in that order."
msgstr "貨物、現在選択中の船、または装備屋から、この順序で装備を惑星の保管庫へ移動します。"

#. [ES10-0649] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip outfitter: r | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:890
msgctxt "ES10-0649"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to store 5, 20, or 500 outfits at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500個の装備を保管できます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの装備を保管できます。"

#. [ES10-0650] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip shipyard: b | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:893
msgctxt "ES10-0650"
msgid "Buy this ship."
msgstr "この船を購入します。"

#. [ES10-0651] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip shipyard: b | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:894
msgctxt "ES10-0651"
msgid "Hold Shift, Control, or Alt to buy 5, 20, or 500 ships at once. Hold a combination of these keys for larger amounts."
msgstr "Shift、Control、またはAltキーを押しながら操作すると、一度に5、20、または500隻の船を購入できます。これらのキーを組み合わせて押すと、一度にさらに多くの船を購入できます。"

#. [ES10-0652] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip shipyard: s | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:897
msgctxt "ES10-0652"
msgid "Sell the selected ships and their outfits."
msgstr "選択した船とその装備を売却します。"

#. [ES10-0653] Scope: Core | Category: Tutorial help | Source context: tip shipyard: r | Text role: tooltip body | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Tooltip lookup key remains unchanged. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/_ui/tooltips.txt:900
msgctxt "ES10-0653"
msgid "Sell the hulls of the selected ships, but retain the outfits in storage."
msgstr "選択した船の船体のみを売却し、装備は保管庫に残します。"

#. [ES10-0654] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Earth | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:1402
msgctxt "ES10-0654"
msgid "Earth"
msgstr "地球"

#. [ES10-0655] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Earth | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:1405
msgctxt "ES10-0655"
msgid "The ancestral home world of humanity, Earth has a population twice that of any other inhabited planet. Sprawling cities cover large portions of its surface, many of them overcrowded and dangerous. Some people work to scrape together enough money to leave, while at the same time others, born on distant worlds, make a pilgrimage of sorts to see this planet that once cradled the entirety of the human species."
msgstr "人類の故郷である地球は、他のどの居住惑星の2倍の人口を抱えています。広大な都市が地表の大部分を覆っており、その多くは過密で危険な状態です。地球を離れるための資金を必死に稼ごうとする人々がいる一方で、遠く離れた世界で生まれた人々が、かつて人類全体を育んだこの惑星を見るために巡礼のような旅をしています。"

#. [ES10-0656] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Earth | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:1408
msgctxt "ES10-0656"
msgid "The ancestral home world of humanity, as well as your own birthplace, Earth has a population twice that of any other planet. Sprawling cities cover its surface, many of them overcrowded and dangerous. Some people work to scrape together enough money to leave, while others, born on distant worlds, make a pilgrimage of sorts to see this planet that once cradled the entirety of the human species."
msgstr "人類の祖先の故郷であり、あなた自身の出生地でもある地球は、他のどの惑星の2倍の人口を抱えています。地表は広大な都市で覆われており、その多くは過密で危険な場所です。地球を離れるための資金を必死に稼ごうとする人々がいる一方で、遠く離れた惑星で生まれ、かつて人類という種全体を育んだこの惑星を見るために巡礼のような旅をする人々もいます。"

#. [ES10-0657] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Earth | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:1411
msgctxt "ES10-0657"
msgid "{1}Earth is also the capital of the Republic. Representative government becomes complicated when one planet has a greater population than a hundred planets elsewhere. As a result, smaller settlements are grouped together into planetary districts that elect a single representative between them - a source of much frustration in the frontier worlds."
msgstr "{1}地球は共和国の首都でもあります。ある惑星の人口が他の100の惑星の人口を合わせた数よりも多いと、代議制民主主義は複雑になります。その結果、小さな居住地は惑星地区にまとめられ、その地区から代表者が1人選出されますが、これは辺境の惑星では大きな不満の種となっています。"

#. [ES10-0658] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Earth | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:1412
msgctxt "ES10-0658"
msgid "Earth's spaceport is a series of massive buildings; the gaps between them form narrow concrete canyons a hundred stories deep. From a distance it has the appearance of a bustling termite mound."
msgstr "地球の宇宙港は巨大な建物が連なっており、その隙間が100階分の深さの狭いコンクリートの峡谷を形成しています。遠くから見ると、それは賑やかなシロアリの塚のように見えます。"

#. [ES10-0659] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Earth | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:1413
msgctxt "ES10-0659"
msgid "{1}Inside the towers is a warren of dim hallways and dingy shops. Hitchhikers sleep in the corners of unused docking bays under old army blankets, a few uniformed cleaners try to keep the litter and dust in check, and rich tourists from other stars cling tightly to their expensive cameras."
msgstr "{1}塔の内部は、薄暗い廊下と薄汚れた店が入り組んだ迷路のようになっています。ヒッチハイカーは使われていないドッキングベイの隅で古い軍用毛布にくるまって眠り、制服を着た清掃員が数人、ゴミや埃を片付けようと奮闘し、他の星から来た裕福な観光客は高価なカメラをしっかりと握りしめています。"

#. [ES10-0660] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Gemstone | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2095
msgctxt "ES10-0660"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "ジェムストーン"

#. [ES10-0661] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Gemstone | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2098
msgctxt "ES10-0661"
msgid "Gemstone is a hot and unpleasant world, mostly due to a smoggy atmosphere high in methane. Much of the surface is covered in rugged mountains, making ground transport very difficult. However, the powerful tectonic forces here have created rich deposits of diamonds, emeralds, and sapphires, which are mined for use in jewelry and certain electronic components."
msgstr "ジェムストーンは、メタンを多く含むスモッグのような大気のせいで、暑く不快な惑星です。地表の大部分は険しい山々に覆われており、地上輸送は非常に困難です。しかし、ここの強力な地殻変動によって、ダイヤモンド、エメラルド、サファイアの豊富な鉱床が形成されており、それらは宝飾品や特定の電子部品に使用するために採掘されています。"

#. [ES10-0662] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Gemstone | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2099
msgctxt "ES10-0662"
msgid "{1}Mining a tectonically active world is an insane project. Earthquakes cause frequent cave-ins, but the potential for riches draws miners here despite high mortality rates. Most miners are dirt poor as a result of being paid on commission for their finds, but they are full of stories of some distant acquaintance who became mind-bogglingly wealthy after striking a previously untapped gemstone deposit."
msgstr "{1}地殻活動が活発な惑星での採掘は、狂気の沙汰と言えるプロジェクトです。地震による落盤が頻発しますが、高い死亡率にもかかわらず、富への可能性が鉱山労働者をここに引き寄せます。ほとんどの鉱山労働者は、発見物に対する歩合制で支払われるため極めて貧しいですが、未開拓の宝石鉱床を掘り当てて信じられないほどの大金持ちになった遠い知人の話で持ちきりです。"

#. [ES10-0663] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Gemstone | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2100
msgctxt "ES10-0663"
msgid "The spaceport is perched on top of a peak in an older and more stable mountain range. The landing pads here are used both by starships and by the helicopters that bring cargo to and from the mines. Overhead, helicopters fly by carrying heavy loads dangling from cables. A few low concrete buildings serve as warehouses, and on the far end of the port, where an explosion would do the least damage if a sudden, severe earthquake struck, large steel tanks hold deuterium for refueling ships. Asphalt roads with flimsy guard rails connect the landing pads to the warehouses."
msgstr "宇宙港は、より古く安定した山脈の一つの山頂に位置しています。ここの着陸パッドは、宇宙船だけでなく、鉱山との間で貨物を運ぶヘリコプターにも使用されています。頭上では、ヘリコプターがケーブルから重い荷物をぶら下げて飛び交っています。低いコンクリートの建物が倉庫として使われており、突然の激しい地震で爆発が起きても被害が最小限で済む港の端には、船の燃料補給用の重水素を貯蔵する大きな鋼鉄製のタンクがあります。頼りないガードレールのついたアスファルトの道路が、着陸パッドと倉庫をつないでいます。"

#. [ES10-0664] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Gemstone | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2101
msgctxt "ES10-0664"
msgid "{1}In commemoration of Remembrance Day, a few flags have been set up in the spaceport. You suspect that the risk of an earthquake puts the locals off of setting up anything more elaborate."
msgstr "{1}戦没者追悼記念日にちなみ、宇宙港にはいくつかの旗が立てられています。地震のリスクがあるため、地元の人々はこれ以上手の込んだものを設置する気にはなれないのでしょう。"

#. [ES10-0665] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Heartland | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2479
msgctxt "ES10-0665"
msgid "Heartland"
msgstr "ハートランド"

#. [ES10-0666] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Heartland | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2482
msgctxt "ES10-0666"
msgid "Heartland is a pleasant world, with a geography mostly consisting of low hills, plains, and oceans. The farms here produce bountiful crops, and as a result it has drawn tens of millions of settlers. Many of them now work in factories or assembly lines, in which most of the farm equipment used here and in the surrounding systems is built."
msgstr "ハートランドは、なだらかな丘陵、平原、海が大部分を占める地形を持つ、快適な惑星です。ここの農場では豊かな作物が収穫されるため、数千万人の入植者が集まりました。彼らの多くは現在、工場や組立ラインで働いており、そこでこの惑星や周辺の星系で使用される農機具のほとんどが製造されています。"

#. [ES10-0667] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Heartland | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2483
msgctxt "ES10-0667"
msgid "{1}Tractors from Heartland are trusted to be well-built and sturdy, and easy to repair; some are still in use that were built over a century ago."
msgstr "{1}ハートランド製のトラクターは、作りが良く頑丈で、修理もしやすいと評判で、1世紀以上前に製造されたものも今なお使われています。"

#. [ES10-0668] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Heartland | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2484
msgctxt "ES10-0668"
msgid "The spaceport is a cluster of low buildings. At the center of the port is a special, taller building with glass walls on all sides. It houses the tractor showroom. The farmers visiting the showroom look about as excited as you do when touring a large and well-appointed shipyard. There are tractors with rubber wheels, spiked wheels, and tracks; with plows, combines, balers, and chaser bins; tractors barely big enough to sit on and tractors the size of a small freighter. It's somewhat overwhelming."
msgstr "宇宙港は低い建物が集まった場所です。港の中央には、四方がガラス張りの特別な高い建物があります。そこはトラクターのショールームになっています。ショールームを訪れる農家の人々は、あなたが大きく設備の整った造船所を見学する時と同じくらい興奮しているようです。ゴムタイヤやスパイク付きの車輪、クローラーを備えたもの、プラウやコンバイン、ベーラー、チェイサービンを装備したものなど、座るのがやっとの小さなトラクターから小型貨物船ほどの大きさのものまであります。少し圧倒されてしまいます。"

#. [ES10-0669] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Heartland | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Freighter (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2485
msgctxt "ES10-0669"
msgid "{1}One section of the tractor showcase appears to currently be dedicated to antique tractors back from the Alpha Wars. On one landing pad, you spot some dock workers unloading a gigantic wheeled harvester out of a Bulk Freighter's hold."
msgstr "{1}トラクター展示場の一角は、現在、アルファ戦争時代のアンティークトラクター専用になっているようです。ある着陸パッドでは、港湾労働者がバルク貨物船の船倉から巨大な車輪付き収穫機を降ろしているのが見えます。"

#. [ES10-0670] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Hestia | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor; Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2567
msgctxt "ES10-0670"
msgid "Hestia"
msgstr "ヘスティア"

#. [ES10-0671] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Hestia | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor; Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2570
msgctxt "ES10-0671"
msgid "In the distant past, Hestia was a nearly lifeless ice world. It is now a subtropical paradise, one of the great victories from the heyday of planetary engineering back when the galactic economy had more money to spare for terraforming."
msgstr "遠い昔、ヘスティアはほとんど生命のいない氷の惑星でした。現在では亜熱帯の楽園となっており、銀河経済にテラフォーミングのための資金が潤沢にあった惑星工学の全盛期における大きな成果の一つです。"

#. [ES10-0672] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Hestia | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor; Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2571
msgctxt "ES10-0672"
msgid "{1}Today it is mostly a retirement community for those who can afford it, although most of the population consists of young service workers in rented housing who take care of the retirees."
msgstr "{1}今日では、主に経済的に余裕のある人々のための退職者コミュニティとなっていますが、人口の大部分を占めるのは、賃貸住宅に住み、退職者の世話をする若いサービス業従事者です。"

#. [ES10-0673] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Hestia | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor; Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2572
msgctxt "ES10-0673"
msgid "{1}On Hestia, the poor live in cities; the rich live in country estates. Aside from the urban centers, most of this world is covered in rolling green hills and oceans."
msgstr "{1}ヘスティアでは、貧しい人々は都市に住み、裕福な人々は田園地帯の邸宅に住んでいます。都市中心部を除けば、この惑星の大部分は緑豊かな丘陵と海で覆われています。"

#. [ES10-0674] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Hestia | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor; Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2573
msgctxt "ES10-0674"
msgid "Hestia has two separate spaceports. The port where rich residents and their visitors arrive and depart is private, owned by a local company. Here in the public spaceport, no attempt has been made at impressive architecture: everything is spare and utilitarian, with floors of bare concrete. There are a few trucks and forklifts carrying cargo, but the streets that connect the landing pads are mostly full of people on foot, walking toward the customs building."
msgstr "ヘスティアには2つの独立した宇宙港があります。裕福な住民やその訪問者が利用する港は私有で、地元企業が所有しています。こちらの公共の宇宙港では、印象的な建築を目指すような試みはなされておらず、すべてが質素で実用的であり、床はむき出しのコンクリートです。貨物を運ぶトラックやフォークリフトが数台ありますが、着陸パッドを結ぶ通りは、税関ビルに向かって歩く人々でほとんど埋め尽くされています。"

#. [ES10-0675] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Ingot | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2771
msgctxt "ES10-0675"
msgid "Ingot"
msgstr "インゴット"

#. [ES10-0676] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Ingot | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2774
msgctxt "ES10-0676"
msgid "Ingot is a volcanic moon, totally unsuitable for life but rich in metal. The miners who work here must spend all their time inside pressurized buildings."
msgstr "インゴットは火山性の衛星で、生命が生存するにはまったく適していませんが、金属が豊富です。ここで働く鉱山労働者は、常に気圧が保たれた建物の中で過ごさなければなりません。"

#. [ES10-0677] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: Ingot | Text role: description | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2775
msgctxt "ES10-0677"
msgid "{1}Because Ingot has almost no atmosphere to slow them down, meteorites are a constant danger to the colonists. The shells of the buildings have multiple layers, designed to be self-sealing in any but the largest of impacts. Most of the mining is done remotely by robotic vehicles, but someone still needs to be present to control them and to make repairs when something goes wrong."
msgstr "{1}インゴットには大気がほとんどなく、隕石の速度を落とすことができないため、入植者にとって隕石は常に危険な存在です。建物の外殻は多層構造になっており、最大級の衝突でない限り、損傷箇所を自動的に塞ぐように設計されています。採掘作業のほとんどはロボット車両によって遠隔操作で行われていますが、それらを制御し、何らかのトラブルが発生した際に修理を行うためには、依然として誰かが現地にいる必要があります。"

#. [ES10-0678] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Ingot | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2776
msgctxt "ES10-0678"
msgid "In this spaceport, ships dock inside a hangar whose ceiling protects them from meteorite impacts. The hangar is not pressurized, so there are also landing tubes that connect to each of the visiting ships. Many of the people inside are carrying emergency oxygen masks in case a sudden impact ruptures the building."
msgstr "この宇宙港では、船は隕石の衝突から天井で守られた格納庫内にドッキングします。格納庫は加圧されていないため、寄港する各船につながる乗降用の通路もあります。建物内にいる人々の多くは、突然の衝突で建物が破損した場合に備え、緊急用酸素マスクを携帯しています。"

#. [ES10-0679] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Ingot | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2777
msgctxt "ES10-0679"
msgid "{1}In addition to being the spaceport, this complex is also the repair and control center for the mining robots. There are a handful of buildings elsewhere on Ingot, but not many. You cannot imagine spending so much time with so little space or change of scenery."
msgstr "{1}この施設は宇宙港であるだけでなく、採掘ロボットの修理・制御センターでもあります。インゴットの他の場所にも建物はいくつかありますが、それほど多くはありません。これほど狭い場所で、景色も変わらない環境でこれほど長い時間を過ごすことは、あなたには想像もできないでしょう。"

#. [ES10-0680] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: Ingot | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Freighter; Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:2778
msgctxt "ES10-0680"
msgid "{1}The decorations for Remembrance Day on this planet amount to a batch of flags placed near a trading hub. The spirit of the locals, however, is undeniable; you can feel folk songs echo through the metal corridors."
msgstr "{1}この惑星の戦没者追悼記念日の飾り付けは、交易拠点の近くに掲げられた数本の旗だけです。しかし、地元の人々の心意気は確かなもので、金属製の廊下に民謡が響き渡るのを感じられます。"

#. [ES10-0681] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3889
msgctxt "ES10-0681"
msgid "New Boston"
msgstr "ニューボストン"

#. [ES10-0682] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3892
msgctxt "ES10-0682"
msgid "New Boston is a completely unremarkable world. Most of its land is wet and marshy, and the coastal regions are prone to flooding. The planet's economy is largely agricultural; some of the farms here grow food for export to Earth and elsewhere, but most farmland is dedicated to fiber crops, destined for processing in the textile mills of the spaceport city."
msgstr "ニューボストンは全く平凡な世界です。土地の大部分は湿地帯で、沿岸地域は洪水に見舞われやすい場所です。惑星の経済は主に農業で、ここの農場の一部は地球や他の場所への輸出用に作物を栽培していますが、農地の大部分は繊維作物に充てられており、それらは宇宙港都市の繊維工場で加工されることになります。"

#. [ES10-0683] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3896
msgctxt "ES10-0683"
msgid "New Boston is a completely unremarkable world... except, of course, for the fact that you happen to have been born here."
msgstr "ニューボストンは全く平凡な世界です……もちろん、あなたがたまたまここで生まれたという事実を除けばですが。"

#. [ES10-0684] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3899
msgctxt "ES10-0684"
msgid "{1}Most of the land is wet and marshy, and the coastal regions are prone to flooding. Some food crops are grown here, but most of the farmers instead plant flax and jute, which grow well in wet soil and are used to make linen and burlap cloth. The textile mills are hot and poorly ventilated, but they offer higher and more reliable income than farming."
msgstr "{1}土地の大部分は湿地帯で、沿岸地域は洪水に見舞われやすい場所です。ここでは食料作物も栽培されていますが、農家の多くは代わりに亜麻やジュートを植えています。これらは湿った土壌でよく育ち、リネンや麻布を作るために使われます。繊維工場は暑く換気も不十分ですが、農業よりも高く安定した収入が得られます。"

#. [ES10-0685] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3903
msgctxt "ES10-0685"
msgid "Someday New Boston may be a prosperous enough planet to afford a better spaceport, but not yet. Many of the concrete landing pads have sunk into the muddy soil over the years since they were poured, and are now tilted and uneven."
msgstr "いつかニューボストンも、より良い宇宙港を持てるほど豊かな惑星になるかもしれませんが、今はまだです。コンクリート製の着陸パッドの多くは、打設されてから長い年月の間にぬかるんだ地面に沈み込み、今では傾いて表面がでこぼこになっています。"

#. [ES10-0686] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3906
msgctxt "ES10-0686"
msgid "New Boston's shabby spaceport is about as basic as a spaceport can be. Many of the concrete landing pads are tilted and uneven, sunken into the muddy soil over time, and you have to be careful when touching down."
msgstr "ニューボストンのみすぼらしい宇宙港は、宇宙港として必要最低限の設備しかありません。コンクリート製の着陸パッドの多くは、時間の経過とともにぬかるんだ地面に沈み込み、傾いて表面がでこぼこになっているため、着陸時には注意が必要です。"

#. [ES10-0687] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3909
msgctxt "ES10-0687"
msgid "{1}The market where ship captains buy and sell cargo is a large tent rather than a permanent building, but it is sturdy enough to keep off the rain. Loads are brought in and out by trucks and the occasional hovercraft. Here some enterprising local mechanics have set up not only a repair shop and outfitter, but also a shipyard with several small, refurbished ships for sale."
msgstr "{1}船長たちが貨物を売買する市場は、常設の建物ではなく大きなテントですが、雨をしのぐには十分な頑丈さがあります。荷物はトラックや時折やってくるホバークラフトで運び込まれ、運び出されます。ここでは、進取の気性に富んだ地元の整備士たちが、修理工場や装備品店だけでなく、数隻の改装済み小型船を販売する造船所まで立ち上げています。"

#. [ES10-0688] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Boston | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3910
msgctxt "ES10-0688"
msgid "{1}A smaller tent has been set up beside the market. Inside are various pamphlets for Remembrance Day events occurring on New Boston."
msgstr "{1}市場の隣には、より小さなテントが設置されています。中には、ニューボストンで開催される戦没者追悼記念日のイベントに関する様々なパンフレットが置かれています。"

#. [ES10-0689] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New China | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3944
msgctxt "ES10-0689"
msgid "New China"
msgstr "ニューチャイナ"

#. [ES10-0690] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New China | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3947
msgctxt "ES10-0690"
msgid "In the very early days of hyperspace travel, most settlers chose to put down roots within a few jumps of Earth, because until more fuel depots were built, colonies farther out would seldom be visited by cargo ships. As a result, a lot of effort was put into terraforming and developing worlds that would have been passed over by most colonists today."
msgstr "ハイパースペース航行の黎明期、ほとんどの入植者は地球から数ジャンプ以内の場所に定住することを選びました。燃料補給基地がもっと建設されるまでは、遠く離れた植民地を貨物船が訪れることはめったになかったからです。その結果、今日であればほとんどの入植者が通り過ぎてしまうような惑星のテラフォーミングと開発に、多大な努力が注がれました。"

#. [ES10-0691] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New China | Text role: description | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3948
msgctxt "ES10-0691"
msgid "{1}New China is one such world, and it is now overpopulated, and poor enough that maintaining the terraforming equipment and climate requires almost a third of the planetary government's tax income."
msgstr "{1}ニューチャイナはそのような惑星の一つであり、現在では人口過剰で貧しく、テラフォーミング設備と気候を維持するために惑星政府の税収のほぼ3分の1を費やさなければならないほどです。"

#. [ES10-0692] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New China | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3949
msgctxt "ES10-0692"
msgid "The \"new port\" here was built several centuries ago, when the grand but impractical spaceport built by the original settlers had deteriorated to the point where it was no longer usable. This port is much simpler by comparison: just a ring of landing pads of various sizes around a large central building with ten levels of warehouse space accessible by freight elevator."
msgstr "ここの「新しい港」は、最初の入植者が建設した壮大だが非実用的な宇宙港が老朽化し、使用できなくなった数世紀前に建設された。この港はそれに比べるとはるかに単純で、貨物用エレベーターでアクセスできる10層の倉庫スペースを備えた大きな中央建物の周囲に、さまざまな大きさの着陸パッドが環状に配置されているだけだ。"

#. [ES10-0693] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New China | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Transport (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3950
msgctxt "ES10-0693"
msgid "{1}There are always locals hanging around the port, some of them mere children, who are trying to find a cheap ride off-planet."
msgstr "{1}港にはいつも、惑星を離れるための安い便を探す地元の人々がたむろしており、中にはまだ子供もいる。"

#. [ES10-0694] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3971
msgctxt "ES10-0694"
msgid "New Greenland"
msgstr "ニューグリーンランド"

#. [ES10-0695] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3974
msgctxt "ES10-0695"
msgid "New Greenland was first settled about six hundred years ago, at the peak of the \"Turf Wars\" era where most planets were controlled by powerful corporations and their struggles often turned into outright warfare with privately owned fleets and armies. The people who came to New Greenland were looking for a world so marginal and undesirable that they could live here in peace without being caught in the crossfire."
msgstr "ニューグリーンランドに最初に入植者がやって来たのは約600年前のことだ。当時は「縄張り戦争」時代の絶頂期であり、ほとんどの惑星は強力な企業によって支配され、その争いはしばしば企業が所有する艦隊や軍隊を使った全面戦争へと発展していた。ニューグリーンランドに来た人々は、争いに巻き込まれず平和に暮らせるほど条件が悪く魅力もない世界を求めていたのだ。"

#. [ES10-0696] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: description | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3975
msgctxt "ES10-0696"
msgid "{1}The locals here grow food in greenhouses and specialize in making warm winter clothing, which is this planet's only export."
msgstr "{1}ここの住民は温室で食料を栽培し、この惑星唯一の輸出品である暖かい冬服の製造を専門としている。"

#. [ES10-0697] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3976
msgctxt "ES10-0697"
msgid "The spaceport is near the equator, but it is still cold enough that there is always some snow on the ground."
msgstr "宇宙港は赤道付近にあるが、それでも地面には常に雪が残るほど寒い。"

#. [ES10-0698] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3977
msgctxt "ES10-0698"
msgid "{1}You have never seen as many people in fur coats as there are here; what might be considered a luxury elsewhere is a necessity here, where the cheapest clothing material is the pelts of indigenous animals."
msgstr "{1}これほど多くの人が毛皮のコートを着ている光景は見たことがない。他所では贅沢品と見なされるかもしれないものがここでは必需品であり、最も安価な衣類素材は現地の動物の毛皮である。"

#. [ES10-0699] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3978
msgctxt "ES10-0699"
msgid "{1}From the size of the claws hanging decoratively off some of the coats, you have to give a grudging respect to the hunters. High fashion is not an industry that usually involves risk of dismemberment."
msgstr "{1}コートの一部に飾りとしてぶら下がっている爪の大きさを見ると、狩人たちには渋々ながらも敬意を抱かざるを得ない。ハイファッションは普通、手足を失う危険を伴う産業ではない。"

#. [ES10-0700] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Greenland | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: All classic routes (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:3979
msgctxt "ES10-0700"
msgid "{1}New Greenland was one of the worlds occupied during the Alpha Wars. Despite this, Remembrance Day celebrations on New Greenland are quite humble, with most simply going about business as usual."
msgstr "{1}ニューグリーンランドはアルファ戦争中に占領された惑星の一つである。それにもかかわらず、ニューグリーンランドでの追悼記念日の行事はごく控えめで、ほとんどの人は普段どおりに過ごしている。"

#. [ES10-0701] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Sahara | Text role: planet display fallback | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Proper name; retain canonical planet ID. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:4070
msgctxt "ES10-0701"
msgid "New Sahara"
msgstr "ニューサハラ"

#. [ES10-0702] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Sahara | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:4073
msgctxt "ES10-0702"
msgid "New Sahara is mostly desert and savanna, with very little precipitation."
msgstr "ニューサハラは大部分が砂漠とサバンナで、降水量は非常に少ない。"

#. [ES10-0703] Scope: Core | Category: Locations | Source context: New Sahara | Text role: description | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:4074
msgctxt "ES10-0703"
msgid "{1}A century ago, some entrepreneurs settled here and built a factory complex that is entirely powered by wind and solar energy, because there are so few cloudy days here and the wind and sunshine are so reliable. The factory is mostly autonomous, with only a few thousand people living here to perform maintenance or to grow crops in irrigated fields."
msgstr "{1}1世紀前、何人かの起業家がここに入植し、風力と太陽光エネルギーだけで稼働する工場群を建設した。ここでは曇りの日がほとんどなく、風と日照が非常に安定しているからである。工場はほぼ自動化されており、メンテナンスや灌漑農地での作物栽培のために数千人が居住しているに過ぎない。"

#. [ES10-0704] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Sahara | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:4075
msgctxt "ES10-0704"
msgid "The spaceport consists of a few large concrete slabs, each big enough for a dozen small ships or a pair of Bulk Freighters to land on. Farther away are fields of solar panels and the factories that they power. The spaceport buildings themselves, however, are underground, where less energy is needed to keep the air cool. Light pipes bring sunlight down from the surface to illuminate the subterranean storage caverns and living quarters, while keeping the searing heat of the sunlight out."
msgstr "宇宙港はいくつかの大きなコンクリートスラブで構成されており、それぞれ小型船なら12隻、大型貨物船なら2隻が着陸できる広さがある。さらに遠くには太陽光パネルの設置された一帯と、それらが電力を供給する工場がある。しかし、宇宙港の建物自体は地下にあり、空気を冷やすためのエネルギー消費を抑えている。採光管が地表から地下の貯蔵洞窟や居住区へ日光を通して内部を照らしつつ、日光の強烈な熱は遮っている。"

#. [ES10-0705] Scope: Optional | Category: Locations | Source context: New Sahara | Text role: spaceport | Route / branch: Interceptor (annotates: general; from: developer)
#. Localization notes: Contains literal paragraph-indentation tab. Optional spaceport flavor; general randomized encounters/news are excluded. (annotates: general; from: developer)
#: data/map planets.txt:4076
msgctxt "ES10-0705"
msgid "{1}The living quarters have been modestly decorated for Remembrance Day, with ceremonial flags displayed inside the dining hall and Alpha Wars medals set up along a corridor, each one belonging to an ancestor of those who immigrated here."
msgstr "{1}居住区は追悼記念日のために控えめに装飾されており、食堂内には儀式用の旗が掲げられ、廊下にはアルファ戦争の勲章が並べられている。どの勲章も、ここに移住した人々の先祖のものだ。"

